(70621, 2224, 714, '<td valign="top">I love how you captured to different weathers.  Way cool!</td>', 'I love how you captured to different weathers.  Way cool!', '2002-06-10 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70622, 2224, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting weather!</td>', 'interesting weather!', '2002-06-10 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70623, 2224, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  I like the sunset in the rain.</td>', 'Very cool picture.  I like the sunset in the rain.', '2002-06-10 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70624, 2224, 573, '<td valign="top">Neat way to look at a sunset.</td>', 'Neat way to look at a sunset.', '2002-06-10 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70625, 2224, 139, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot.  I''ve never seen a photo of both the eastern and western sky during a sunset.  The contrast between the two is quite interesting.</td>', 'Impressive shot.  I''ve never seen a photo of both the eastern and western sky during a sunset.  The contrast between the two is quite interesting.', '2002-06-10 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70626, 2224, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors.</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors.', '2002-06-10 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70627, 2224, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative work, nicely done.</td>', 'Creative work, nicely done.', '2002-06-10 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70628, 2224, 1897, '<td valign="top">Wow, a rear view mirror shot.</td>', 'Wow, a rear view mirror shot.', '2002-06-10 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70629, 2224, 1446, '<td valign="top">Lots of distracting elements in this photo IMO.</td>', 'Lots of distracting elements in this photo IMO.', '2002-06-11 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70630, 2224, 1882, '<td valign="top">interesting.  I didn''t know you could see a sunset on a miserably rainy and cloudy day.  Unless there was some trickery here....hmmm...</td>', 'interesting.  I didn''t know you could see a sunset on a miserably rainy and cloudy day.  Unless there was some trickery here....hmmm...', '2002-06-11 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70631, 2224, 2126, '<td valign="top">Pity about that rain (although you would no doubt had trouble getting that light when it wasn''t raining), although it does highten the contrast between the sunset and the gloomy clouds</td>', 'Pity about that rain (although you would no doubt had trouble getting that light when it wasn''t raining), although it does highten the contrast between the sunset and the gloomy clouds', '2002-06-11 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70632, 2224, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and color effect.</td>', 'Nice concept and color effect.', '2002-06-11 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70633, 2224, 1313, '<td valign="top">not crisp</td>', 'not crisp', '2002-06-11 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70634, 2224, 2094, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the stormy blue outside and the calm sunset in your mirror... Might have been better without the stoplight right there, but still a really cool shot.</td>', 'Great contrast between the stormy blue outside and the calm sunset in your mirror... Might have been better without the stoplight right there, but still a really cool shot.', '2002-06-12 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70635, 2224, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve never gotten such deep color in a reflected sunset (I''m usually driving, too) -- and an interesting effect with te mirror splitting up the image.</td>', 'I''ve never gotten such deep color in a reflected sunset (I''m usually driving, too) -- and an interesting effect with te mirror splitting up the image.', '2002-06-12 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70636, 2224, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a particularly nice photo... Looking out the window of the car into the rain, It''s hard to imagine that the red sunset behind you is actually real :)  I suppose that a little ''surrealism'' is always nice in a photo... great shot!</td>', 'This is a particularly nice photo... Looking out the window of the car into the rain, It''s hard to imagine that the red sunset behind you is actually real :)  I suppose that a little ''surrealism'' is always nice in a photo... great shot!', '2002-06-12 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70637, 2224, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good yse of colorl I love the contrast between the rain in front and the sunset in back.</td>', 'Good yse of colorl I love the contrast between the rain in front and the sunset in back.', '2002-06-12 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70638, 2224, 1042, '<td valign="top">This...is cool. I love the  contrast between the colors...and the contrast between the two seemingly different elements of nature.  And the title...Red light up front...red sky in back...it''s just perfect. I love the way the rain distorts the view from the windshield. The blues and reds are really brilliant. Nice job...</td>', 'This...is cool. I love the  contrast between the colors...and the contrast between the two seemingly different elements of nature.  And the title...Red light up front...red sky in back...it''s just perfect. I love the way the rain distorts the view from the windshield. The blues and reds are really brilliant. Nice job...', '2002-06-13 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70639, 2224, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of contrasting colors.  I also like the irony of sun behind and rain ahead.</td>', 'Excellent use of contrasting colors.  I also like the irony of sun behind and rain ahead.', '2002-06-13 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70640, 2224, 1224, '<td valign="top">window streakyness kinda takes away, but awesome otherwise</td>', 'window streakyness kinda takes away, but awesome otherwise', '2002-06-13 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70641, 2224, 332, '<td valign="top">Meira Ísland :)</td>', 'Meira Ísland :)', '2002-06-15 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70642, 2224, 472, '<td valign="top">colorwise, this is one of the most successful of the rearview shots.  good sense of timing.</td>', 'colorwise, this is one of the most successful of the rearview shots.  good sense of timing.', '2002-06-15 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70643, 2224, 1, '<td valign="top">Where''s the water on the back window?  Cool shot, though i''d ilke to not see the traffic light on the left.</td>', 'Where''s the water on the back window?  Cool shot, though i''d ilke to not see the traffic light on the left.', '2002-06-17 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70644, 2224, 734, '<td valign="top">I really thought this image would have won,.. its by far the best picture submitted for the challenge.. Wonderful job capturing the lighting transition between the sunset and the light throught the front window.. I really love it ..great job.</td>', 'I really thought this image would have won,.. its by far the best picture submitted for the challenge.. Wonderful job capturing the lighting transition between the sunset and the light throught the front window.. I really love it ..great job.', '2002-06-17 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70645, 2225, 1, '<td valign="top">Focus is really weird here, is the girl walking out of focus or blurred?  I think you need to increase your aperature.</td>', 'Focus is really weird here, is the girl walking out of focus or blurred?  I think you need to increase your aperature.', '2002-06-10 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70646, 2225, 436, '<td valign="top">nice composition. showed up a bit too bright on my monitor, but clearly a wonderful shot</td>', 'nice composition. showed up a bit too bright on my monitor, but clearly a wonderful shot', '2002-06-10 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70647, 2225, 641, '<td valign="top">Love this..great composition of the trees.</td>', 'Love this..great composition of the trees.', '2002-06-10 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70648, 2225, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great photo...needs a little more saturation, I think.</td>', 'Great photo...needs a little more saturation, I think.', '2002-06-10 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70649, 2225, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colors.  Reminds me of a misty morning.  I like the parallel trees, but I''m undecided about the asymmetry.</td>', 'Nice soft colors.  Reminds me of a misty morning.  I like the parallel trees, but I''m undecided about the asymmetry.', '2002-06-10 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70650, 2225, 1175, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The railing on the left is a bit distracting.  Would have been nice if you could have zoomed in just a little pass that or maybe stood more to the right.</td>', 'Very nice.  The railing on the left is a bit distracting.  Would have been nice if you could have zoomed in just a little pass that or maybe stood more to the right.', '2002-06-10 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70651, 2225, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compositon, perspective, color, light. NICE work.</td>', 'Wonderful compositon, perspective, color, light. NICE work.', '2002-06-10 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70652, 2225, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very nice. You might have been able to reduce exposure half or one stop and your picture would have a richer texture to it. I like the way the horizontal rails lead your eye to the subject.</td>', 'Very nice. You might have been able to reduce exposure half or one stop and your picture would have a richer texture to it. I like the way the horizontal rails lead your eye to the subject.', '2002-06-10 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70653, 2225, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety 6    interesting  5   focus 6   framing  7  = 6</td>', 'creativety 6    interesting  5   focus 6   framing  7  = 6', '2002-06-11 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70654, 2225, 531, '<td valign="top">yea, i got a nice felling</td>', 'yea, i got a nice felling', '2002-06-11 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70655, 2225, 1897, '<td valign="top">This could use a little more post process, adjusting the contrast, and saturation,  but tihs is a very good shot, and good interpretation on the theme</td>', 'This could use a little more post process, adjusting the contrast, and saturation,  but tihs is a very good shot, and good interpretation on the theme', '2002-06-11 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70656, 2225, 806, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, but isn''t this on a path?</td>', 'This is beautiful, but isn''t this on a path?', '2002-06-11 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70657, 2225, 1882, '<td valign="top">Geez, Mom, can''t I ride now?</td>', 'Geez, Mom, can''t I ride now?', '2002-06-11 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70658, 2225, 1759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Nicely metered and a appropriately soft. I would like to see the full size file for this one. Nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Nicely metered and a appropriately soft. I would like to see the full size file for this one. Nice photo.', '2002-06-11 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70659, 2225, 1005, '<td valign="top">Technically, isn''t this a trail?  A very nice photo.  Here is another instance where the resolution we are required to use hurts the detail of your shot.  Generally, the closer you are to your subjects, the more distinct they appear.  Higher resolution can keep more of that detail, FYI only, no score effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Road ?6? (pushing the envelope) total 7</td>', 'Technically, isn''t this a trail?  A very nice photo.  Here is another instance where the resolution we are required to use hurts the detail of your shot.  Generally, the closer you are to your subjects, the more distinct they appear.  Higher resolution can keep more of that detail, FYI only, no score effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Road ?6? (pushing the envelope) total 7', '2002-06-11 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70660, 2225, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The colors feel a little washed out/too light.  More important than that, however, I think it needs to be rotated a few degrees clockwise.  Everybody''s leaning a little to their right.</td>', 'I like it.  The colors feel a little washed out/too light.  More important than that, however, I think it needs to be rotated a few degrees clockwise.  Everybody''s leaning a little to their right.', '2002-06-12 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70661, 2225, 2094, '<td valign="top">Great composition and framing... My only small complaint is that it seems a bit too bright. I think it would add a nice effect if it were darker with more pronounced shadows.</td>', 'Great composition and framing... My only small complaint is that it seems a bit too bright. I think it would add a nice effect if it were darker with more pronounced shadows.', '2002-06-12 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70662, 2225, 862, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I''d like to see better focus on the two women.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I''d like to see better focus on the two women.', '2002-06-12 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70663, 2225, 1024, '<td valign="top">The use of leading line is very well done here.</td>', 'The use of leading line is very well done here.', '2002-06-12 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70664, 2225, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and framing on this photo... the subject matter is also very interesting... I believe that the photo may be slightly over exposed... good work!</td>', 'I love the composition and framing on this photo... the subject matter is also very interesting... I believe that the photo may be slightly over exposed... good work!', '2002-06-12 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70665, 2225, 1553, '<td valign="top">nicely framed picture</td>', 'nicely framed picture', '2002-06-12 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70666, 2225, 1054, '<td valign="top">A unique interpretation of the theme.  I like it, great composition.</td>', 'A unique interpretation of the theme.  I like it, great composition.', '2002-06-13 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70667, 2225, 509, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a little dry here, but otherwise a very nice shot.  The focus of the wood on the left is a little distracting - taking the shot from the center of the path might clear that up.</td>', 'The colors seem a little dry here, but otherwise a very nice shot.  The focus of the wood on the left is a little distracting - taking the shot from the center of the path might clear that up.', '2002-06-13 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70668, 2225, 1202, '<td valign="top">I only wish that you could have gotton rid of the fuzzy post on the left, otherwise a wondeful , and loving picture.   It is one that gets the viewers attention and draws them back for another look, and is good enough to be displayed.</td>', 'I only wish that you could have gotton rid of the fuzzy post on the left, otherwise a wondeful , and loving picture.   It is one that gets the viewers attention and draws them back for another look, and is good enough to be displayed.', '2002-06-13 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70669, 2225, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of closeness this picture has; however, I feel like if you had taken a step or two to the right, so the trees were symmetrical, it would have been better (in my opinion).  The red jacket gives some nice color.</td>', 'I like the feeling of closeness this picture has; however, I feel like if you had taken a step or two to the right, so the trees were symmetrical, it would have been better (in my opinion).  The red jacket gives some nice color.', '2002-06-13 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
