(70720, 2229, 885, '<td valign="top">I think for a shot like this, it might have been better to shoot straight down, instead of at that angle.</td>', 'I think for a shot like this, it might have been better to shoot straight down, instead of at that angle.', '2002-06-12 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70721, 2229, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I don''t know your camera so what I''m about to suggest may be entirely useless.  I think, instead of going for the entire manhole cover, that you could have gone for a more interesting look by getting closer and only showing a portion of the whole.  Maybe the tree, the pattern surrounding it, the date, and a little of the road?  As it stands, the perfectly centered oval just doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'OK, I don''t know your camera so what I''m about to suggest may be entirely useless.  I think, instead of going for the entire manhole cover, that you could have gone for a more interesting look by getting closer and only showing a portion of the whole.  Maybe the tree, the pattern surrounding it, the date, and a little of the road?  As it stands, the perfectly centered oval just doesn''t do much for me.', '2002-06-12 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70722, 2229, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, did you try this in b/w?</td>', 'Nice capture, did you try this in b/w?', '2002-06-13 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
