(70931, 2253, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, only a few small problems, all nits:  Sky was probably cloudy, but appears overexposed (all whited out); the LONG poart of the cemetery name is very difficult to read, maybe a half step to your left; especial nit  -  isn''t this technically off the road?  Is the EXIT ONLY supposed to be a reference to death?  Nice touch.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 8  (see:  these really were NITs)</td>', 'Nice photo, only a few small problems, all nits:  Sky was probably cloudy, but appears overexposed (all whited out); the LONG poart of the cemetery name is very difficult to read, maybe a half step to your left; especial nit  -  isn''t this technically off the road?  Is the EXIT ONLY supposed to be a reference to death?  Nice touch.Photo 9 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 8  (see:  these really were NITs)', '2002-06-10 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70932, 2253, 327, '<td valign="top">Great eye.</td>', 'Great eye.', '2002-06-10 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70933, 2253, 1759, '<td valign="top">I really like the storytelling as it fits very well with the theme. However, the photo is a bit cluttered and hard to read. Because of the size, contrast, and position of the signs, my attention was first brought to them and I couldn''t quite make a connection with the theme. After searching awhile I noticed the cemetery sign, but was barely able to read it. In this case it may have worked better to keep the photo simple and include only the cemetery sign.</td>', 'I really like the storytelling as it fits very well with the theme. However, the photo is a bit cluttered and hard to read. Because of the size, contrast, and position of the signs, my attention was first brought to them and I couldn''t quite make a connection with the theme. After searching awhile I noticed the cemetery sign, but was barely able to read it. In this case it may have worked better to keep the photo simple and include only the cemetery sign.', '2002-06-10 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70934, 2253, 554, '<td valign="top">when I do stuff like this I get 1"s---------10</td>', 'when I do stuff like this I get 1"s---------10', '2002-06-10 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
