(70943, 2253, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great combination of signs! :-)  Have you tried cropping (if the quality allows) or taking this shot in portrait format to bring out the emphasis on the signs some more?  I would probably crop just to the right of the gate to the cemetery and then to the left of the street signs - however far you have to go to follow the DPChallenge photo size rules.</td>', 'Great combination of signs! :-)  Have you tried cropping (if the quality allows) or taking this shot in portrait format to bring out the emphasis on the signs some more?  I would probably crop just to the right of the gate to the cemetery and then to the left of the street signs - however far you have to go to follow the DPChallenge photo size rules.', '2002-06-13 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
