(70976, 2255, 472, '<td valign="top">hey that''s some moustache!   ok shot, although subject matter is a bit static (ie not particularly interesting).</td>', 'hey that''s some moustache!   ok shot, although subject matter is a bit static (ie not particularly interesting).', '2002-06-13 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70977, 2255, 570, '<td valign="top">nice moustache</td>', 'nice moustache', '2002-06-13 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70978, 2255, 772, '<td valign="top">Is this car actually moving?  if so, the fast shutter speed didn''t allow any motion blur to enter into the image... i think a little motion blur in a shot like this would add a nice effect :)</td>', 'Is this car actually moving?  if so, the fast shutter speed didn''t allow any motion blur to enter into the image... i think a little motion blur in a shot like this would add a nice effect :)', '2002-06-13 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70979, 2255, 89, '<td valign="top">nice ''stache, bro</td>', 'nice ''stache, bro', '2002-06-13 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70980, 2255, 1707, '<td valign="top">Neat that you got the man''s reflection in the rear view mirror. If it had a bit of white, I''d say "got milk?"</td>', 'Neat that you got the man''s reflection in the rear view mirror. If it had a bit of white, I''d say "got milk?"', '2002-06-14 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70981, 2255, 811, '<td valign="top">A passenger would have made the picture more balanced for me, but then you would have had three people in a two-seater (at least all of the MG''s I''ve ever seen were two seaters).  I like the bright blue.</td>', 'A passenger would have made the picture more balanced for me, but then you would have had three people in a two-seater (at least all of the MG''s I''ve ever seen were two seaters).  I like the bright blue.', '2002-06-15 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70982, 2255, 637, '<td valign="top">Well done, but it doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Well done, but it doesn''t grab me.', '2002-06-15 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70983, 2255, 1379, '<td valign="top">AN MG!  WOW!  <br/><br/>My dad restores MGs as his hobby, so the last 15 years of my life have been rich with conversations about different attributes of the different years.  I drove a  white 1980 for a while, until the engine caught fire one time too often...  Needless to say, I feel a real connection to your photo!</td>', 'AN MG!  WOW!  My dad restores MGs as his hobby, so the last 15 years of my life have been rich with conversations about different attributes of the different years.  I drove a  white 1980 for a while, until the engine caught fire one time too often...  Needless to say, I feel a real connection to your photo!', '2002-06-15 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70984, 2255, 2000, '<td valign="top">nice car.</td>', 'nice car.', '2002-06-16 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70985, 2255, 921, '<td valign="top">I want to thank you all for the nice comments, They are all very encouraging. As I said this was my first submission and I guess i have a ways to go. Next time I''ll give it a bit more thought.<br/>FYI  this is a 1978 MG Midget painted Pagent Blue.  I mounted my tripod behind the seat and used the timer so that I could have my hands in view. I agree I shot the picture at too high a speed, It proablly would have looked better had I shown motion. I didn''t want to go too far with my camera exposed like it was. <br/>BTW this is my wife''s car, it''s a bit too small for me (I''m 6'') but its still a hoot to drive!!<br/><br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'I want to thank you all for the nice comments, They are all very encouraging. As I said this was my first submission and I guess i have a ways to go. Next time I''ll give it a bit more thought.FYI  this is a 1978 MG Midget painted Pagent Blue.  I mounted my tripod behind the seat and used the timer so that I could have my hands in view. I agree I shot the picture at too high a speed, It proablly would have looked better had I shown motion. I didn''t want to go too far with my camera exposed like it was. BTW this is my wife''s car, it''s a bit too small for me (I''m 6'') but its still a hoot to drive!!Thanks again.', '2002-06-17 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70986, 2260, 1122, '<td valign="top">WOW WOW~~~<br/>Great Shot! Hope you didn''t crash your car intentionally for this photo. &amp;gt;,&amp;lt;<br/>Very Powerful Picture, honestly.</td>', 'WOW WOW~~~Great Shot! Hope you didn''t crash your car intentionally for this photo. &gt;,&lt;Very Powerful Picture, honestly.', '2002-06-10 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70987, 2260, 1360, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the "jarred camera motion" in this shot; it adds to the sense of motion, confusion, and "accident-ness"...</td>', 'I like the idea of the "jarred camera motion" in this shot; it adds to the sense of motion, confusion, and "accident-ness"...', '2002-06-10 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70988, 2260, 205, '<td valign="top">I love the chaos in this picture.</td>', 'I love the chaos in this picture.', '2002-06-10 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70989, 2260, 1226, '<td valign="top">Wow. normally i do not like things completely out of focus, but it just fits this one perfectly. I don''t want to use the words lucky or cool, but your sure did happen upon an interesting events for the theme of this picture.</td>', 'Wow. normally i do not like things completely out of focus, but it just fits this one perfectly. I don''t want to use the words lucky or cool, but your sure did happen upon an interesting events for the theme of this picture.', '2002-06-10 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70990, 2260, 1528, '<td valign="top">wow, did you actually catch this happening this week?</td>', 'wow, did you actually catch this happening this week?', '2002-06-10 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70991, 2260, 885, '<td valign="top">Is that for real?  The unsteadiness of the camera is rightfully disconcerting.</td>', 'Is that for real?  The unsteadiness of the camera is rightfully disconcerting.', '2002-06-10 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70992, 2260, 1041, '<td valign="top">Geez, I hope no one got hurt.  Did you shake the camera for the blurry / light swirl effect?  Not sure that works for me.</td>', 'Geez, I hope no one got hurt.  Did you shake the camera for the blurry / light swirl effect?  Not sure that works for me.', '2002-06-10 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70993, 2260, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that would have been improved with the use of a tripod.  Camera shake is exaggerated when you are using a slow shutter speed.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that would have been improved with the use of a tripod.  Camera shake is exaggerated when you are using a slow shutter speed.', '2002-06-10 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70994, 2260, 1944, '<td valign="top">Wow! Bet that hurt.</td>', 'Wow! Bet that hurt.', '2002-06-10 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70995, 2260, 327, '<td valign="top">This is too cool, great job. Congrats.</td>', 'This is too cool, great job. Congrats.', '2002-06-10 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70996, 2260, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool... the movement effect of the picture gives a very surreal feeling.</td>', 'Cool... the movement effect of the picture gives a very surreal feeling.', '2002-06-10 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70997, 2260, 573, '<td valign="top">This is either a fortunate grab shot of an unfortunate accident or the busiest paint with light picture I have ever seen, wow how did you do it?</td>', 'This is either a fortunate grab shot of an unfortunate accident or the busiest paint with light picture I have ever seen, wow how did you do it?', '2002-06-11 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70998, 2260, 1313, '<td valign="top">poor taste</td>', 'poor taste', '2002-06-11 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70999, 2260, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Your camera shake on this shot does an excellent job of conveying a sense of chaos in this shot.  I think this is the first shot done this way I have seen in any of these challenges that works well... good job!</td>', 'Nice work!  Your camera shake on this shot does an excellent job of conveying a sense of chaos in this shot.  I think this is the first shot done this way I have seen in any of these challenges that works well... good job!', '2002-06-12 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71000, 2260, 871, '<td valign="top">I like the use of motion!</td>', 'I like the use of motion!', '2002-06-12 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71001, 2260, 2173, '<td valign="top">full macabra!!!</td>', 'full macabra!!!', '2002-06-12 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71002, 2260, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is on great shot, I feel like I am seeing the accident as it happens.</td>', 'This is on great shot, I feel like I am seeing the accident as it happens.', '2002-06-12 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71003, 2260, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of chaos here.</td>', 'I like the feeling of chaos here.', '2002-06-13 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71004, 2260, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this shot needed to be defended in the forums, it is very cool.  The motion blurs make it more real.  Great job!</td>', 'I don''t think this shot needed to be defended in the forums, it is very cool.  The motion blurs make it more real.  Great job!', '2002-06-13 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71005, 2260, 1446, '<td valign="top">I find this kind of dark and grainy, but I really like the look of chaos that you captured here.</td>', 'I find this kind of dark and grainy, but I really like the look of chaos that you captured here.', '2002-06-13 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71006, 2260, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the blur makes me feel like the wreck is happening has I watch.  It''s creepy, but has a powerful effect.  Hope no one was seriously hurt.</td>', 'I think the blur makes me feel like the wreck is happening has I watch.  It''s creepy, but has a powerful effect.  Hope no one was seriously hurt.', '2002-06-13 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71007, 2260, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve gotten a sense of motion and mood of tradgedy.</td>', 'I like how you''ve gotten a sense of motion and mood of tradgedy.', '2002-06-13 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71008, 2260, 1379, '<td valign="top">Yeesh!  I hope no one was hurt!</td>', 'Yeesh!  I hope no one was hurt!', '2002-06-13 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71009, 2260, 2210, '<td valign="top">I will wager a guess only. The car was stopped and the camera shook?</td>', 'I will wager a guess only. The car was stopped and the camera shook?', '2002-06-14 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71010, 2260, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s tragic! If this is a real accident, I hope no one was killed.... but I suspect it was pretty bad. The shaking of the camera creates a real feeling of fear and anxiety. Very effective.</td>', 'That''s tragic! If this is a real accident, I hope no one was killed.... but I suspect it was pretty bad. The shaking of the camera creates a real feeling of fear and anxiety. Very effective.', '2002-06-14 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71011, 2260, 47, '<td valign="top">too blurry to give proof this is a real accident</td>', 'too blurry to give proof this is a real accident', '2002-06-15 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71012, 2260, 1175, '<td valign="top">I''m ver interested in seeing how you got this picture.</td>', 'I''m ver interested in seeing how you got this picture.', '2002-06-16 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(71013, 2260, 1, '<td valign="top">The camera jitter effect actualy works well here, it adds a sense of havoc to the scene.</td>', 'The camera jitter effect actualy works well here, it adds a sense of havoc to the scene.', '2002-06-17 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71014, 2263, 2, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph -- astounding lighting, great textures, and an absolutely wonderful subject and composition.  My early favorite.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph -- astounding lighting, great textures, and an absolutely wonderful subject and composition.  My early favorite.', '2002-06-10 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71015, 2263, 205, '<td valign="top">This very eye catching, good job</td>', 'This very eye catching, good job', '2002-06-10 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71016, 2263, 1446, '<td valign="top">My favorite photograph of the week. I love the light and shadows on this. The texture is very good. Perfect choice for a b&amp;w.  Cant suggest anything I might change.</td>', 'My favorite photograph of the week. I love the light and shadows on this. The texture is very good. Perfect choice for a b&w.  Cant suggest anything I might change.', '2002-06-10 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71017, 2263, 1, '<td valign="top">Interested in knowing what the title means...  Nice shot the lighting is awesome as is the feeling of lonliness/despair.</td>', 'Interested in knowing what the title means...  Nice shot the lighting is awesome as is the feeling of lonliness/despair.', '2002-06-10 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71018, 2263, 656, '<td valign="top">excellent shadow placement</td>', 'excellent shadow placement', '2002-06-10 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71019, 2263, 1856, '<td valign="top">very creative...if I was into this sort of thing, I would definitely hang it on my wall.</td>', 'very creative...if I was into this sort of thing, I would definitely hang it on my wall.', '2002-06-10 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71020, 2263, 255, '<td valign="top">sweet! I love this. I also have no idea what the title means... (is it a constellation or something?) but, very nice job! 10.</td>', 'sweet! I love this. I also have no idea what the title means... (is it a constellation or something?) but, very nice job! 10.', '2002-06-10 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71021, 2263, 885, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that i don''t know what the title means.  But I really like this picture.  How did you get that beam of light?  The B&amp;W is an excellent choice.  Good job.</td>', 'I have to admit that i don''t know what the title means.  But I really like this picture.  How did you get that beam of light?  The B&W is an excellent choice.  Good job.', '2002-06-10 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71022, 2263, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, and I think black and white gives it a feeling of a lonely traveler (dont know if that''s what you intended or not).  For my own personal taste, though, the suitcase feels a little too close to the left side and bottom for me.  Doesn''t change the quality of the picture a great deal, though, jsut a personal thing.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, and I think black and white gives it a feeling of a lonely traveler (dont know if that''s what you intended or not).  For my own personal taste, though, the suitcase feels a little too close to the left side and bottom for me.  Doesn''t change the quality of the picture a great deal, though, jsut a personal thing.', '2002-06-10 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71023, 2263, 327, '<td valign="top">Great light, great shot. Love the tones. Perfect!!</td>', 'Great light, great shot. Love the tones. Perfect!!', '2002-06-10 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71024, 2263, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like the artistic feel of this one. The light patterns on the road really make this one, and I trust that the latch was intentionally left open too. Good eye!</td>', 'I like the artistic feel of this one. The light patterns on the road really make this one, and I trust that the latch was intentionally left open too. Good eye!', '2002-06-10 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71025, 2263, 737, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-06-10 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71026, 2263, 1042, '<td valign="top">I''ve  tried to look this up...pyxis is casket or box....and I''m assuming this is latin....but anyway, I love the detail in this.</td>', 'I''ve  tried to look this up...pyxis is casket or box....and I''m assuming this is latin....but anyway, I love the detail in this.', '2002-06-10 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71027, 2263, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo not only shows a nice interpretation of being ''on the road''... It also, being in black and white, conveys a sense of solitude... possibly uncertainty as well... the light beam shining on the suitcase tells me that the journey down the unknown road ahead is being taken with caution... the uneven and dark lighting on the road ahead tells me that this journey may be a difficult and turbulent one, to say the least... This photo tells me a nice story... nice work!</td>', 'This photo not only shows a nice interpretation of being ''on the road''... It also, being in black and white, conveys a sense of solitude... possibly uncertainty as well... the light beam shining on the suitcase tells me that the journey down the unknown road ahead is being taken with caution... the uneven and dark lighting on the road ahead tells me that this journey may be a difficult and turbulent one, to say the least... This photo tells me a nice story... nice work!', '2002-06-11 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71028, 2263, 531, '<td valign="top">ok nice</td>', 'ok nice', '2002-06-11 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71029, 2263, 1897, '<td valign="top">I am tired of seeing things "on the road"  and I do not know why everything is so squiggly, especially the black,  and what does that title mean?</td>', 'I am tired of seeing things "on the road"  and I do not know why everything is so squiggly, especially the black,  and what does that title mean?', '2002-06-11 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71030, 2263, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love the picture, can''t wait ti hear what the title means.</td>', 'I love the picture, can''t wait ti hear what the title means.', '2002-06-12 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71031, 2263, 933, '<td valign="top">Yes, I''m a sucker for negative space. Nice lighting.  I''m sure you have already recieved numerous comments about what a good entry this would be for next weeks contest, so I will refrain.  ;?)  Well done!</td>', 'Yes, I''m a sucker for negative space. Nice lighting.  I''m sure you have already recieved numerous comments about what a good entry this would be for next weeks contest, so I will refrain.  ;?)  Well done!', '2002-06-13 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71032, 2263, 472, '<td valign="top">one of the better shots in this challenge: artful, creative, well lit.</td>', 'one of the better shots in this challenge: artful, creative, well lit.', '2002-06-13 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71033, 2263, 1379, '<td valign="top">Simple graceful beauty.  It''s thick with opportunity for interpretation.  Awesome.</td>', 'Simple graceful beauty.  It''s thick with opportunity for interpretation.  Awesome.', '2002-06-13 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71034, 2263, 1651, '<td valign="top">awesome.</td>', 'awesome.', '2002-06-13 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71035, 2263, 1122, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! Great Control on Lighting</td>', 'Great Shot! Great Control on Lighting', '2002-06-14 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71036, 2263, 1024, '<td valign="top">Oh I bet you wish you could use this in the "Shadows" challenge.  Nice moody feeling.</td>', 'Oh I bet you wish you could use this in the "Shadows" challenge.  Nice moody feeling.', '2002-06-14 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71037, 2263, 1847, '<td valign="top">I dunno what the title means, but the picture is great!  So spare, but so rich with possible stories.</td>', 'I dunno what the title means, but the picture is great!  So spare, but so rich with possible stories.', '2002-06-15 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71038, 2263, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the title means, but this is so beautiful I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'I don''t know what the title means, but this is so beautiful I''m giving it 10.', '2002-06-16 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71039, 2263, 255, '<td valign="top">15th????? unbelievable patella! i fully expected to see this photo right there on the home page! ah, well...i still love it the best! oh--and the title?....;)</td>', '15th????? unbelievable patella! i fully expected to see this photo right there on the home page! ah, well...i still love it the best! oh--and the title?....;)', '2002-06-17 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(71040, 2263, 1897, '<td valign="top">I do not know why I rated this so low, I must have been having a bad day.  This is really good.</td>', 'I do not know why I rated this so low, I must have been having a bad day.  This is really good.', '2002-06-18 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(71041, 2264, 139, '<td valign="top">I''m not impressed by the post-processing.  I would love to see this photo in its original form.</td>', 'I''m not impressed by the post-processing.  I would love to see this photo in its original form.', '2002-06-10 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71042, 2264, 1122, '<td valign="top">A stunning photo, and even a bit frightening.<br/>The unconfortable oversaturated colour gives the photo <br/>a very special feeling and a big contrast of the road and the red flower. <br/>Eye-catching!</td>', 'A stunning photo, and even a bit frightening.The unconfortable oversaturated colour gives the photo a very special feeling and a big contrast of the road and the red flower. Eye-catching!', '2002-06-10 03:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71043, 2264, 656, '<td valign="top">the filter effect is a bit too heavy for my tastes</td>', 'the filter effect is a bit too heavy for my tastes', '2002-06-10 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71044, 2264, 885, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better without the screwed up levels, I think.  The lone poppy is striking.</td>', 'I''d like it better without the screwed up levels, I think.  The lone poppy is striking.', '2002-06-10 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71045, 2264, 641, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2002-06-10 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71046, 2264, 1944, '<td valign="top">In my view, the process doesn''t work all that well for the subject chosen.</td>', 'In my view, the process doesn''t work all that well for the subject chosen.', '2002-06-10 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71047, 2264, 1569, '<td valign="top">The posterization is kind of distracting. I would like to see this as a regular pix and the top cropped down to the top of the right guard rail.</td>', 'The posterization is kind of distracting. I would like to see this as a regular pix and the top cropped down to the top of the right guard rail.', '2002-06-10 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71048, 2264, 1024, '<td valign="top">I would really like to know how you achieved this effect.... almost lilke a painting</td>', 'I would really like to know how you achieved this effect.... almost lilke a painting', '2002-06-10 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71049, 2264, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool shot, love the poppy!</td>', 'Kool shot, love the poppy!', '2002-06-10 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71050, 2264, 616, '<td valign="top">you shouldn''t have used that effect</td>', 'you shouldn''t have used that effect', '2002-06-10 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71051, 2264, 1009, '<td valign="top">Good job... I like the grain and artistic side of this challenge.</td>', 'Good job... I like the grain and artistic side of this challenge.', '2002-06-10 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71052, 2264, 1543, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2002-06-10 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71053, 2264, 554, '<td valign="top">I like it!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! looks like something I would try. 11</td>', 'I like it!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! looks like something I would try. 11', '2002-06-10 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71054, 2264, 1759, '<td valign="top">I found this photo interesting. Almost doesn''t look like a photo with the high saturation. Good find of a poppy in such a place.</td>', 'I found this photo interesting. Almost doesn''t look like a photo with the high saturation. Good find of a poppy in such a place.', '2002-06-10 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71055, 2264, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been an excellent photo without the heavy modifications... When a photo is modified to the point where it doesn''t look like a photo anymore, it loses points on my scale :(</td>', 'I think this would have been an excellent photo without the heavy modifications... When a photo is modified to the point where it doesn''t look like a photo anymore, it loses points on my scale :(', '2002-06-11 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71056, 2264, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety 7  interesting 9 focus N/A framing 8 =8</td>', 'creativety 7  interesting 9 focus N/A framing 8 =8', '2002-06-11 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71057, 2264, 1897, '<td valign="top">scewing with the color does not make this any better.  Probably would have been better untouched.  Would be good in not for the powerlines.</td>', 'scewing with the color does not make this any better.  Probably would have been better untouched.  Would be good in not for the powerlines.', '2002-06-11 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71058, 2264, 1446, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, not a big fan of this type of thing, but overall the composition is ok.  I wish the horizon was straight. The power lines are kind of out of place IMO. Giving you a 7 for imagination and originality.</td>', 'Like the colors, not a big fan of this type of thing, but overall the composition is ok.  I wish the horizon was straight. The power lines are kind of out of place IMO. Giving you a 7 for imagination and originality.', '2002-06-11 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
