(71158, 2268, 878, '<td valign="top">Its nice to see a hotwheel shot where the car takes the complete frame of the photo.  Very good shot and and layout.</td>', 'Its nice to see a hotwheel shot where the car takes the complete frame of the photo.  Very good shot and and layout.', '2002-06-11 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
