(71169, 2269, 1, '<td valign="top">Although probably impossible, I think this shot would''ve been so much better without cars.</td>', 'Although probably impossible, I think this shot would''ve been so much better without cars.', '2002-06-10 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71170, 2269, 772, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photo except the sign in the upper right corner... *I* would like to see the whole sign or none of it... The architecture and the shadows provided here are excellent.  It''s obvoiusly a bright day here :)  If this was *my* photo, I would have made a few level adjustments to tone down the brightness a tad and create even more contrasts by the architecture and the shadows... good work!</td>', 'I like everything about this photo except the sign in the upper right corner... *I* would like to see the whole sign or none of it... The architecture and the shadows provided here are excellent.  It''s obvoiusly a bright day here :)  If this was *my* photo, I would have made a few level adjustments to tone down the brightness a tad and create even more contrasts by the architecture and the shadows... good work!', '2002-06-10 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71171, 2269, 573, '<td valign="top">"PREPARE ... WHEN ..."   what?  A nice sharp picture but somathing is missing, motion blur maybe?</td>', '"PREPARE ... WHEN ..."   what?  A nice sharp picture but somathing is missing, motion blur maybe?', '2002-06-10 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
