(71200, 2270, 327, '<td valign="top">Speed kills! &amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; fun shot, done very well.</td>', 'Speed kills! &lt;lol&gt; fun shot, done very well.', '2002-06-10 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71201, 2270, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  In this case, did you try any lower angle?  (trick time:  get the road in the distance wet w/ hot water.  Makes cool heat waves!)<br/>Honestly, I don''t have any good suggestions to improve this photo.  It''s well done.  (Was the car in motion?)<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 8  (a high 8)</td>', 'Nice macro.  In this case, did you try any lower angle?  (trick time:  get the road in the distance wet w/ hot water.  Makes cool heat waves!)Honestly, I don''t have any good suggestions to improve this photo.  It''s well done.  (Was the car in motion?)Photo 8 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 8  (a high 8)', '2002-06-10 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71202, 2270, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Some motion blur on the car might add a bit to this one. I''m wondering if a smaller focal length shot closer could give more a feeling that the cars in the background are more to scale and maybe exaggerate the size of the model. Good job on this one.</td>', 'Cute shot. Some motion blur on the car might add a bit to this one. I''m wondering if a smaller focal length shot closer could give more a feeling that the cars in the background are more to scale and maybe exaggerate the size of the model. Good job on this one.', '2002-06-10 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71203, 2270, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail... nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice detail... nice shot.', '2002-06-10 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
