(71214, 2270, 1202, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.   Looks like it was fun to do.   Farrari seems to be a little outof focus but good pic.</td>', 'Interesting concept.   Looks like it was fun to do.   Farrari seems to be a little outof focus but good pic.', '2002-06-12 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
