(71234, 2273, 156, '<td valign="top">i like the sense of speed in the foreground...but the distant view is too blurry</td>', 'i like the sense of speed in the foreground...but the distant view is too blurry', '2002-06-11 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71235, 2273, 2109, '<td valign="top">makes my eyes bug out ;)</td>', 'makes my eyes bug out ;)', '2002-06-11 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71236, 2273, 806, '<td valign="top">What a rush!</td>', 'What a rush!', '2002-06-11 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71237, 2273, 573, '<td valign="top">Good use of blur to show motion but reminds me of a long booring drive,  will ya I guess,  good entry.</td>', 'Good use of blur to show motion but reminds me of a long booring drive,  will ya I guess,  good entry.', '2002-06-11 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71238, 2273, 2094, '<td valign="top">The colors are really nice... Basically just two colors, nice and vivid. The blur is interesting to look at - definitely gives the pic a feeling of speed. I imagine it would have been rather difficult to do, but I think if the camera had been more over to the right and the other side of the street out of the frame entirely, I would like it a bit more.</td>', 'The colors are really nice... Basically just two colors, nice and vivid. The blur is interesting to look at - definitely gives the pic a feeling of speed. I imagine it would have been rather difficult to do, but I think if the camera had been more over to the right and the other side of the street out of the frame entirely, I would like it a bit more.', '2002-06-11 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71239, 2273, 811, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of blur, I think.</td>', 'Very effective use of blur, I think.', '2002-06-11 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71240, 2273, 885, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the side is blurred but not the front.  Really gives a good feeling of being in the car, cause that''s how it looks :)</td>', 'It''s interesting how the side is blurred but not the front.  Really gives a good feeling of being in the car, cause that''s how it looks :)', '2002-06-12 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71241, 2273, 1658, '<td valign="top">Sense of motion is engaging.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Sense of motion is engaging.  Nicely done.', '2002-06-12 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71242, 2273, 1135, '<td valign="top">I love the motion blur on this photo. I feel like I am in the car!</td>', 'I love the motion blur on this photo. I feel like I am in the car!', '2002-06-12 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
