(71246, 2273, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice motion effect.  I almost wish that car in the background wasn''t there, but I guess you can''t really tell traffic to stop using the road = P</td>', 'Very nice motion effect.  I almost wish that car in the background wasn''t there, but I guess you can''t really tell traffic to stop using the road = P', '2002-06-13 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
