(71249, 2273, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and nice bright green foliage. The blur effect is cool.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and nice bright green foliage. The blur effect is cool.', '2002-06-16 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71250, 2273, 2199, '<td valign="top">very nice sense of acceleration...</td>', 'very nice sense of acceleration...', '2002-06-16 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71251, 2275, 318, '<td valign="top">The title makes it good, shame about that fence, though!</td>', 'The title makes it good, shame about that fence, though!', '2002-06-10 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71252, 2275, 573, '<td valign="top">Too much motion blur makes my eyes tired.</td>', 'Too much motion blur makes my eyes tired.', '2002-06-10 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71253, 2275, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you are trying to do with this photo, but, unfortunately, to me, this is still jsut a blurry cemetery photo, that doesn''t stand well on its own (w/out the title).</td>', 'I think I know what you are trying to do with this photo, but, unfortunately, to me, this is still jsut a blurry cemetery photo, that doesn''t stand well on its own (w/out the title).', '2002-06-10 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71254, 2275, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting title for this photograph, considering the view is of the graveyard :)  I think i get it :)  The sense of motion in this photograph works really well for me... I know this could not be avoided but the iron post fence between you and the graveyard creates a nice blur, but the horizontal top of the fence sets a distinct horizontal break in this photo that is somewhat distracting.  It took me a few moments to realize what I was looking at on that issue... thought for the day: In a photograph or any other piece of artwork, I don''t think it''s a good idea to leave your viewer wondering what they are looking at, not withstanding the issues with abstract art.  Good job :)</td>', 'This is an interesting title for this photograph, considering the view is of the graveyard :)  I think i get it :)  The sense of motion in this photograph works really well for me... I know this could not be avoided but the iron post fence between you and the graveyard creates a nice blur, but the horizontal top of the fence sets a distinct horizontal break in this photo that is somewhat distracting.  It took me a few moments to realize what I was looking at on that issue... thought for the day: In a photograph or any other piece of artwork, I don''t think it''s a good idea to leave your viewer wondering what they are looking at, not withstanding the issues with abstract art.  Good job :)', '2002-06-10 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71255, 2275, 811, '<td valign="top">It''s really interesting how you were able to get some of it in focus, and some of it not.  Makes it look like the tree is moving very fast, and the tombstones are frozen (an interesting metaphor).  You may or may not have had control of the black pole-thing in the middle and the black horizontal stripe, but it gives the impression that you shot on the fly without considering composition.</td>', 'It''s really interesting how you were able to get some of it in focus, and some of it not.  Makes it look like the tree is moving very fast, and the tombstones are frozen (an interesting metaphor).  You may or may not have had control of the black pole-thing in the middle and the black horizontal stripe, but it gives the impression that you shot on the fly without considering composition.', '2002-06-10 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71256, 2275, 327, '<td valign="top">Great title, fun creative shot.</td>', 'Great title, fun creative shot.', '2002-06-10 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71257, 2275, 1005, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for, but the effect makes me a little ill (weak stomach).  Your motion object (read:tree) is maybe a bit too close and the fence almost blurred out of existance, but enough to hurt the image (my boss had the same reaction, w/o my help).  (Small nit:  reflection in middle of frame)<br/>Photo 5 Creativity 9 Road 8 total 7</td>', 'I see what you were going for, but the effect makes me a little ill (weak stomach).  Your motion object (read:tree) is maybe a bit too close and the fence almost blurred out of existance, but enough to hurt the image (my boss had the same reaction, w/o my help).  (Small nit:  reflection in middle of frame)Photo 5 Creativity 9 Road 8 total 7', '2002-06-10 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71258, 2275, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha... thats pretty funny. I like a sick sense of humor. Er... I hope you were being funny.</td>', 'Hahahaha... thats pretty funny. I like a sick sense of humor. Er... I hope you were being funny.', '2002-06-10 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71259, 2275, 1907, '<td valign="top">morrrrrrrbid...!</td>', 'morrrrrrrbid...!', '2002-06-11 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
