(71303, 2276, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s always a photo that stands out the first time I look at the thumbnails for each challenge, which I usually end up giving a 10. This was it this week :). Very beautiful composition, with those rolling hills and the pose you caught this guy in. The light is bright but not washed out (you must have used a filter), the colours are beautiful and vivid. One of my favourites.</td>', 'There''s always a photo that stands out the first time I look at the thumbnails for each challenge, which I usually end up giving a 10. This was it this week :). Very beautiful composition, with those rolling hills and the pose you caught this guy in. The light is bright but not washed out (you must have used a filter), the colours are beautiful and vivid. One of my favourites.', '2002-06-15 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71304, 2276, 2235, '<td valign="top">Picture well done. Overall content is pleasing. Contrast and placement is good.<br/>I might have tried a shot at a distance to show long lonely road if possible.</td>', 'Picture well done. Overall content is pleasing. Contrast and placement is good.I might have tried a shot at a distance to show long lonely road if possible.', '2002-06-16 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
