(71500, 2286, 1759, '<td valign="top">Hope this wasn''t your bus. It''s one of those rare moments that we sometimes get. Overall, good exposure, nice sky, focus, etc. I''m thinking that a different angle might have worked a little better, but I do like the way it is framed between the rock formations.</td>', 'Hope this wasn''t your bus. It''s one of those rare moments that we sometimes get. Overall, good exposure, nice sky, focus, etc. I''m thinking that a different angle might have worked a little better, but I do like the way it is framed between the rock formations.', '2002-06-10 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
