(71503, 2286, 1041, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just hate it when that happens?  Were you on the bus?  What a great opportunity for this week''s challenge.  I''m not really sure how I would''ve composed this differently, maybe ROT or move in closer, but the truck and bus being in the middle of the shot doesn''t really appeal to me.  Maybe a closeup from w/in that group of passengers with some of them in the shot and only part of the truck?  Hard to say w/out being there.</td>', 'Don''t you just hate it when that happens?  Were you on the bus?  What a great opportunity for this week''s challenge.  I''m not really sure how I would''ve composed this differently, maybe ROT or move in closer, but the truck and bus being in the middle of the shot doesn''t really appeal to me.  Maybe a closeup from w/in that group of passengers with some of them in the shot and only part of the truck?  Hard to say w/out being there.', '2002-06-11 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
