(71530, 2287, 1005, '<td valign="top">Almost a great shot!  It''s kinda hard to make out as the subject is a bit dark.  Figures on the hill top are barely discernable.  (Congrats on getting sky to show up)  Is the truck spinning out/throwing dirt? (kinda looks that way, but it''s soooo hard to see, my poor old, old eyes)<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road (another pushing the envelope, but getting the benefit of doubt for interpretation thing) 6 total 7<br/>(Shouldn''t this be in the Off Road Challenge, instead of the On The Road Challenge?)</td>', 'Almost a great shot!  It''s kinda hard to make out as the subject is a bit dark.  Figures on the hill top are barely discernable.  (Congrats on getting sky to show up)  Is the truck spinning out/throwing dirt? (kinda looks that way, but it''s soooo hard to see, my poor old, old eyes)Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road (another pushing the envelope, but getting the benefit of doubt for interpretation thing) 6 total 7(Shouldn''t this be in the Off Road Challenge, instead of the On The Road Challenge?)', '2002-06-11 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
