(71571, 2290, 1882, '<td valign="top">uh...ok</td>', 'uh...ok', '2002-06-11 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71572, 2290, 2094, '<td valign="top">Interesting... Very zen-like. The low sun angle adds nice strong shadows on the subject and the texture of the road as well. A look of determination on the subject''s face... Staring into the sun as if to oppose it. Nice shot!</td>', 'Interesting... Very zen-like. The low sun angle adds nice strong shadows on the subject and the texture of the road as well. A look of determination on the subject''s face... Staring into the sun as if to oppose it. Nice shot!', '2002-06-11 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71573, 2290, 811, '<td valign="top">Maybe frame it so that the subject is down and to the left slightly, then the shadow won''t run out of the picture quite so much.</td>', 'Maybe frame it so that the subject is down and to the left slightly, then the shadow won''t run out of the picture quite so much.', '2002-06-11 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71574, 2290, 573, '<td valign="top">Watch out here comes a truuuccckkkk!!!!!   Nice picture couldnt be more on topic for this Challenge.  Why black &amp; white?</td>', 'Watch out here comes a truuuccckkkk!!!!!   Nice picture couldnt be more on topic for this Challenge.  Why black & white?', '2002-06-11 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71575, 2290, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety 2 interesting 1 focus 6 framing 9=4</td>', 'creativety 2 interesting 1 focus 6 framing 9=4', '2002-06-11 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71576, 2290, 121, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this at all, I''m sorry. What is he doing? did someone steal his bike?  Technically it looks OK though</td>', 'I don''t get this at all, I''m sorry. What is he doing? did someone steal his bike?  Technically it looks OK though', '2002-06-11 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71577, 2290, 885, '<td valign="top">I think a more off-center composition might have been more dynamic.  I like the pose and the expression though.</td>', 'I think a more off-center composition might have been more dynamic.  I like the pose and the expression though.', '2002-06-12 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71578, 2290, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a perfectly good composition for the most part, but the lighting or brightness of this photo seems a little weak.. This looks like either early morning or late afternoon based on the length of the shadow... I''m not sure why you chose black and white... maybe color would have been better on this one?</td>', 'This is a perfectly good composition for the most part, but the lighting or brightness of this photo seems a little weak.. This looks like either early morning or late afternoon based on the length of the shadow... I''m not sure why you chose black and white... maybe color would have been better on this one?', '2002-06-12 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71579, 2290, 1054, '<td valign="top">I look at this and wonder why he''s sitting in the middle of the road... but I keep looking at it so I''m scoring accordingly.</td>', 'I look at this and wonder why he''s sitting in the middle of the road... but I keep looking at it so I''m scoring accordingly.', '2002-06-12 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71580, 2290, 1446, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems to almost cut this in half, but the texture of the road is wonderful.  Glad you chose b&amp;w for this.</td>', 'The horizon seems to almost cut this in half, but the texture of the road is wonderful.  Glad you chose b&w for this.', '2002-06-13 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71581, 2290, 570, '<td valign="top">a car behind him would have made this pic a 10</td>', 'a car behind him would have made this pic a 10', '2002-06-13 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71582, 2290, 89, '<td valign="top">dont stare into the sun.</td>', 'dont stare into the sun.', '2002-06-13 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71583, 2290, 1897, '<td valign="top">What is the point of this??  Really!</td>', 'What is the point of this??  Really!', '2002-06-14 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71584, 2290, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very contemplative. I like the long shadows. The mood of this photo is a bit like some scenes from "My Own Private Idaho". Roads are interesting, symbolic things, you used the concept well.</td>', 'Very contemplative. I like the long shadows. The mood of this photo is a bit like some scenes from "My Own Private Idaho". Roads are interesting, symbolic things, you used the concept well.', '2002-06-14 05:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71585, 2290, 1707, '<td valign="top">the tree next/behind the man''s head bothers me.  Makes him look weird.</td>', 'the tree next/behind the man''s head bothers me.  Makes him look weird.', '2002-06-14 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71586, 2290, 734, '<td valign="top">This shot was interesting to me although many of you didnt get it.  A friend( on the road) and I were on a road trip and on a stop at a rest area he sat in the middle of the road looking westward toward the sun, which happen to be our final destination.  Sunny cali.  I thought it summed up our trip and for me perfectly fit into the challenge,.. sorry so many of you could get past the fact that he was just sitting on the road.  Its quite symbolic to me.  Thanks</td>', 'This shot was interesting to me although many of you didnt get it.  A friend( on the road) and I were on a road trip and on a stop at a rest area he sat in the middle of the road looking westward toward the sun, which happen to be our final destination.  Sunny cali.  I thought it summed up our trip and for me perfectly fit into the challenge,.. sorry so many of you could get past the fact that he was just sitting on the road.  Its quite symbolic to me.  Thanks', '2002-06-17 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(71587, 2290, 1897, '<td valign="top">Now I know the point of it.</td>', 'Now I know the point of it.', '2002-07-06 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(71588, 2292, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.</td>', 'Nice framing.', '2002-06-10 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71589, 2292, 1944, '<td valign="top">nice snapshot</td>', 'nice snapshot', '2002-06-10 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71590, 2292, 327, '<td valign="top">Is that Market Street in Philly? Looks like Ben Franklin up there!? Fun shot and good perspective.</td>', 'Is that Market Street in Philly? Looks like Ben Franklin up there!? Fun shot and good perspective.', '2002-06-10 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71591, 2292, 1054, '<td valign="top">A fellow Philadelphian!  I think this may have been more effective if you shot it from further up the street, perhaps Eakins Oval or even the top of the Art Museum steps.</td>', 'A fellow Philadelphian!  I think this may have been more effective if you shot it from further up the street, perhaps Eakins Oval or even the top of the Art Museum steps.', '2002-06-10 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71592, 2292, 1897, '<td valign="top">what is the point of interest here?  This definitely needs a focal point.</td>', 'what is the point of interest here?  This definitely needs a focal point.', '2002-06-11 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71593, 2292, 1485, '<td valign="top">looks like a tourist picture.. doesn''t embody the feeling of on the road.... too literal.</td>', 'looks like a tourist picture.. doesn''t embody the feeling of on the road.... too literal.', '2002-06-11 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71594, 2292, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety  5    interesting  7     focus 7    framing  6    = 6</td>', 'creativety  5    interesting  7     focus 7    framing  6    = 6', '2002-06-11 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71595, 2292, 1882, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I''ve been there!  Cool!</td>', 'Hey!  I''ve been there!  Cool!', '2002-06-11 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71596, 2292, 772, '<td valign="top">That was nice of those people to block off the street so you could take this photo :)</td>', 'That was nice of those people to block off the street so you could take this photo :)', '2002-06-11 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71597, 2292, 1005, '<td valign="top">A very nice city scape shot.  Are they setting up for a parade?  Good color, details about as crisp as one could hope for, no suggestions for improvement.  (maybe a UV/haze filter?)  Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road 8 total 8</td>', 'A very nice city scape shot.  Are they setting up for a parade?  Good color, details about as crisp as one could hope for, no suggestions for improvement.  (maybe a UV/haze filter?)  Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road 8 total 8', '2002-06-11 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71598, 2292, 1031, '<td valign="top">Not nearly as long as I would have thought. No potholes, I notice...</td>', 'Not nearly as long as I would have thought. No potholes, I notice...', '2002-06-13 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71599, 2292, 472, '<td valign="top">needs some levels work to balance out and bring out some more contrast.  flat, as presented.</td>', 'needs some levels work to balance out and bring out some more contrast.  flat, as presented.', '2002-06-13 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71600, 2292, 1041, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look if the city hall wasn''t slap-bang in the middle of the shot.  The yellow strip leading towards it is good though.</td>', 'I wonder how this would look if the city hall wasn''t slap-bang in the middle of the shot.  The yellow strip leading towards it is good though.', '2002-06-14 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71601, 2293, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot indeed, but the road is quite hard to detect... I believe that shooting this particular image a little closer to dusk would have allowed the roadway to show up a little more and improve the overall impact of the ''on the road'' concept... nice shot, none-the-less... :)</td>', 'This is a neat shot indeed, but the road is quite hard to detect... I believe that shooting this particular image a little closer to dusk would have allowed the roadway to show up a little more and improve the overall impact of the ''on the road'' concept... nice shot, none-the-less... :)', '2002-06-10 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71602, 2293, 205, '<td valign="top">I cant really see the road too well except for a faint white line, which would have went better with the title If I could see the trees as well as the road.</td>', 'I cant really see the road too well except for a faint white line, which would have went better with the title If I could see the trees as well as the road.', '2002-06-10 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71603, 2293, 1, '<td valign="top">Definitely the best choice from the seletion, looks great.</td>', 'Definitely the best choice from the seletion, looks great.', '2002-06-10 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71604, 2293, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like this one...somethings a little off though.  The front leaves are out of focus.  Maybe more light''s needed on the road.  I''m not sure.</td>', 'I like this one...somethings a little off though.  The front leaves are out of focus.  Maybe more light''s needed on the road.  I''m not sure.', '2002-06-10 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71605, 2293, 1122, '<td valign="top">Marvellous!<br/>You did a great photo to make the ground and the background disappear! It is really amazing! Floating trees and lights that lead to the heaven. <br/>Great Shot! Great Title!<br/>Yet the photo can be even better if the trees behind are each one higher than the other. I rated you 9!</td>', 'Marvellous!You did a great photo to make the ground and the background disappear! It is really amazing! Floating trees and lights that lead to the heaven. Great Shot! Great Title!Yet the photo can be even better if the trees behind are each one higher than the other. I rated you 9!', '2002-06-10 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71606, 2293, 885, '<td valign="top">Weird that they light those trees like that.  Wish I could see more of the road, but that may just be my monitor.</td>', 'Weird that they light those trees like that.  Wish I could see more of the road, but that may just be my monitor.', '2002-06-10 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71607, 2293, 1024, '<td valign="top">the lighting on the trees is very eerie.  I like it.</td>', 'the lighting on the trees is very eerie.  I like it.', '2002-06-10 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71608, 2293, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good night shot.</td>', 'Nice composition, good night shot.', '2002-06-10 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71609, 2293, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m not to keen on the title, and I initially didn''t like the photo much, either, but it''s growning on me.  A little bit too much contrast between light and dark.</td>', 'I''m not to keen on the title, and I initially didn''t like the photo much, either, but it''s growning on me.  A little bit too much contrast between light and dark.', '2002-06-10 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71610, 2293, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow, O.K. I thought I had seen the winner previously, but I was wrong, here it is!  Night shots are tricky, did you mean to have softer focus on the first tree?  (Could cost you with other voters)  Too bad you couldn''t "spot edit" the white line.  Really cool look, but the more I look at tree #1, it does bug me.  #1 best idea!<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 10 ++++  Road 8 total 9</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow, O.K. I thought I had seen the winner previously, but I was wrong, here it is!  Night shots are tricky, did you mean to have softer focus on the first tree?  (Could cost you with other voters)  Too bad you couldn''t "spot edit" the white line.  Really cool look, but the more I look at tree #1, it does bug me.  #1 best idea!Photo 8 Creativity 10 ++++  Road 8 total 9', '2002-06-10 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71611, 2293, 1009, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool... I like the way the trees appear out of nowhere</td>', 'Pretty cool... I like the way the trees appear out of nowhere', '2002-06-10 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71612, 2293, 1313, '<td valign="top">Sort of neat but too dark</td>', 'Sort of neat but too dark', '2002-06-10 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(71613, 2293, 737, '<td valign="top">Almost for me. Interesting lighting and composition - but "on the road"?  What did I miss? Also,the foreground is a little blown out for me.</td>', 'Almost for me. Interesting lighting and composition - but "on the road"?  What did I miss? Also,the foreground is a little blown out for me.', '2002-06-10 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71614, 2293, 1897, '<td valign="top">the would be good if a road was not running through it.</td>', 'the would be good if a road was not running through it.', '2002-06-10 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71615, 2293, 1585, '<td valign="top">I love this. Great contrast of light and dark.</td>', 'I love this. Great contrast of light and dark.', '2002-06-11 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71616, 2293, 1907, '<td valign="top">too bright in the upper left...</td>', 'too bright in the upper left...', '2002-06-11 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71617, 2293, 1446, '<td valign="top">The bright lighting on the front tree seems inconsistant to me. Also not a big fan of oof items in the foreground. I do however, like the faint white line along the road.</td>', 'The bright lighting on the front tree seems inconsistant to me. Also not a big fan of oof items in the foreground. I do however, like the faint white line along the road.', '2002-06-11 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71618, 2293, 2094, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful! The contrast is just amazing, and I''m a sucker for such wonderful greens. Very simple, but very impressive!</td>', 'Wow, beautiful! The contrast is just amazing, and I''m a sucker for such wonderful greens. Very simple, but very impressive!', '2002-06-11 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71619, 2293, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2002-06-11 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71620, 2293, 2135, '<td valign="top">This image has potential. It doesn''t seem as though it was colour corrected (the road is very difficult to see).  The image lacks detail.</td>', 'This image has potential. It doesn''t seem as though it was colour corrected (the road is very difficult to see).  The image lacks detail.', '2002-06-11 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71621, 2293, 1519, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty neat.  Just a bit too dark for my taste, but a very nice idea.</td>', 'This one is pretty neat.  Just a bit too dark for my taste, but a very nice idea.', '2002-06-11 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71622, 2293, 1877, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really cool, but.. hmm.. kinda breaching the whole road thing? I dunno. But i love the green!</td>', 'I thought this was really cool, but.. hmm.. kinda breaching the whole road thing? I dunno. But i love the green!', '2002-06-12 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71623, 2293, 472, '<td valign="top">too dark for me. weird discrepancy in brightness values.</td>', 'too dark for me. weird discrepancy in brightness values.', '2002-06-12 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71624, 2293, 1054, '<td valign="top">The high contrast of this image is hard on my eyes.</td>', 'The high contrast of this image is hard on my eyes.', '2002-06-12 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71625, 2293, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effects -- I bet this looked even better before resampling...</td>', 'Nice lighting effects -- I bet this looked even better before resampling...', '2002-06-13 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71626, 2293, 2111, '<td valign="top">beautiful 8</td>', 'beautiful 8', '2002-06-13 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71627, 2293, 2210, '<td valign="top">Can see the difficult in obtaining this shot.</td>', 'Can see the difficult in obtaining this shot.', '2002-06-14 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71628, 2293, 2199, '<td valign="top">I love the bright green/black contrast. Interesting composition....very nice.</td>', 'I love the bright green/black contrast. Interesting composition....very nice.', '2002-06-14 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71629, 2293, 671, '<td valign="top">My favorite picture this week.</td>', 'My favorite picture this week.', '2002-06-15 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71630, 2294, 772, '<td valign="top">I will ride this road one day :)  In this particular photo, I think *I* would have gotten a little closer to the marker or cropped it a little tighter to remove the curb from the right side of the frame.... good job!</td>', 'I will ride this road one day :)  In this particular photo, I think *I* would have gotten a little closer to the marker or cropped it a little tighter to remove the curb from the right side of the frame.... good job!', '2002-06-10 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71631, 2294, 811, '<td valign="top">Did you experiment with other angles, or placing the subject in other parts of the picture?  That would have also been interesting, I think, though potentially dangerous if cars were coming. :-)</td>', 'Did you experiment with other angles, or placing the subject in other parts of the picture?  That would have also been interesting, I think, though potentially dangerous if cars were coming. :-)', '2002-06-10 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71632, 2294, 1054, '<td valign="top">How does this look in B&amp;W?</td>', 'How does this look in B&W?', '2002-06-10 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71633, 2294, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, you hit the nail with the hammer here!  (where''s the road kill carcass?)  Too bad you couldn''t have had a classic ''vette tail end just past the road sign. <br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 Road 10 total 9  (I like the cracks in the road, but didn''t need the off road part, crop closer next time, just a suggestion)</td>', 'Wow, you hit the nail with the hammer here!  (where''s the road kill carcass?)  Too bad you couldn''t have had a classic ''vette tail end just past the road sign. Photo 8 Creativity 7 Road 10 total 9  (I like the cracks in the road, but didn''t need the off road part, crop closer next time, just a suggestion)', '2002-06-10 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71634, 2294, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow. Love it Great idea!! Must be Az. ? Well done, creative, clever, fine job.</td>', 'Wow. Love it Great idea!! Must be Az. ? Well done, creative, clever, fine job.', '2002-06-10 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71635, 2294, 616, '<td valign="top">great shot, a very unique idea. I would have liked it better if the top right corner was cropped away.</td>', 'great shot, a very unique idea. I would have liked it better if the top right corner was cropped away.', '2002-06-10 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71636, 2294, 1009, '<td valign="top">Uhhhhhng... Damn that road gets hot in the middle of summer. I rode it on my motorcycle a few years back...</td>', 'Uhhhhhng... Damn that road gets hot in the middle of summer. I rode it on my motorcycle a few years back...', '2002-06-10 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71637, 2294, 1897, '<td valign="top">this gives me no kicks</td>', 'this gives me no kicks', '2002-06-10 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71638, 2294, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety  2  interesting 1   focus 7   framing   5 =  4</td>', 'creativety  2  interesting 1   focus 7   framing   5 =  4', '2002-06-11 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71639, 2294, 573, '<td valign="top">High marks for nostalgia.</td>', 'High marks for nostalgia.', '2002-06-11 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71640, 2294, 1078, '<td valign="top">The subject matter here is great, but that curb over on the side kind of detracts.  Did you consider a horizontal format that would either include just the road and "sign" (and cut out the curb) or one that showed more of the road going off into the distance (and would include curb, sky, cars, whatever)?  Since this is so monochromatic anyway, you might also want to consider making it B&amp;W -- or at least tweaking the levels.  :-)</td>', 'The subject matter here is great, but that curb over on the side kind of detracts.  Did you consider a horizontal format that would either include just the road and "sign" (and cut out the curb) or one that showed more of the road going off into the distance (and would include curb, sky, cars, whatever)?  Since this is so monochromatic anyway, you might also want to consider making it B&W -- or at least tweaking the levels.  :-)', '2002-06-11 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71641, 2294, 1379, '<td valign="top">Are you getting your kicks?</td>', 'Are you getting your kicks?', '2002-06-13 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71642, 2294, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I''m not an American. I''ve heard of route 66, but I''m not sure what''s significant about it, so to me this is just a picture of some cracked asphalt.</td>', 'Hmm... I''m not an American. I''ve heard of route 66, but I''m not sure what''s significant about it, so to me this is just a picture of some cracked asphalt.', '2002-06-14 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71643, 2294, 2210, '<td valign="top">not really enough contrast.</td>', 'not really enough contrast.', '2002-06-14 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71644, 2294, 1707, '<td valign="top">I have a pair of Route 66 jeans:  idea - somehow combine the two?</td>', 'I have a pair of Route 66 jeans:  idea - somehow combine the two?', '2002-06-15 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71645, 2294, 2203, '<td valign="top">great idea!</td>', 'great idea!', '2002-06-15 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71646, 2294, 748, '<td valign="top">Think I would like to have seen a portrait view to get mote perspective of the road.</td>', 'Think I would like to have seen a portrait view to get mote perspective of the road.', '2002-06-15 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71647, 2294, 554, '<td valign="top">right place-----right time   10</td>', 'right place-----right time   10', '2002-06-16 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71648, 2294, 2000, '<td valign="top">nice title.</td>', 'nice title.', '2002-06-16 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71649, 2294, 1, '<td valign="top">Very nicely framed, I love the angle.</td>', 'Very nicely framed, I love the angle.', '2002-06-17 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71650, 2295, 205, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would have made this more eye catching but I''m sure just getting this shot was difficult for you.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would have made this more eye catching but I''m sure just getting this shot was difficult for you.', '2002-06-10 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71651, 2295, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, I wish you could''ve done more so as not to show yourself takin the shot -- maybe use your other hand to take the shot and keep your left hand on the grip.</td>', 'Very cool shot, I wish you could''ve done more so as not to show yourself takin the shot -- maybe use your other hand to take the shot and keep your left hand on the grip.', '2002-06-10 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71652, 2295, 1856, '<td valign="top">nice...metal doo-hicky could have been a little more polished.</td>', 'nice...metal doo-hicky could have been a little more polished.', '2002-06-10 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71653, 2295, 573, '<td valign="top">Don''t forget to look up at the road once in a while.  Great picture, I like the motion blur, this could only be done as a self portrat?  One of my top ten.</td>', 'Don''t forget to look up at the road once in a while.  Great picture, I like the motion blur, this could only be done as a self portrat?  One of my top ten.', '2002-06-10 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71654, 2295, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat color, and I like the motion blur on the road.</td>', 'Neat color, and I like the motion blur on the road.', '2002-06-10 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71655, 2295, 203, '<td valign="top">This photo makes it into every challenge.</td>', 'This photo makes it into every challenge.', '2002-06-10 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
