(71738, 2299, 878, '<td valign="top">Need to use better software to convert / resize your pictures.  Try IRFAN VIEW its free and great.  I would be willing to bet you camera takes somewhat sharp photos, the colors look nice too.</td>', 'Need to use better software to convert / resize your pictures.  Try IRFAN VIEW its free and great.  I would be willing to bet you camera takes somewhat sharp photos, the colors look nice too.', '2002-06-13 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
