(71751, 2301, 1041, '<td valign="top">I know it''s hard with those ''gotta take this opportunity'' photos to not make them look like snapshots.  Not sure what I would''ve done differently (were you taking the photo from a bus?), but a different angle (if that was possible) maybe would''ve helped.</td>', 'I know it''s hard with those ''gotta take this opportunity'' photos to not make them look like snapshots.  Not sure what I would''ve done differently (were you taking the photo from a bus?), but a different angle (if that was possible) maybe would''ve helped.', '2002-06-11 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
