(71766, 2302, 573, '<td valign="top">Wow, great pic.  Is that a One Lane Road?</td>', 'Wow, great pic.  Is that a One Lane Road?', '2002-06-11 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71767, 2302, 1041, '<td valign="top">This would''ve done well in the b&amp;w challenge, too.  I like the idea, the setup, DOF, it''s really well executed.  My top 3 this week.</td>', 'This would''ve done well in the b&w challenge, too.  I like the idea, the setup, DOF, it''s really well executed.  My top 3 this week.', '2002-06-12 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71768, 2302, 472, '<td valign="top">this is amusing. one of th ebetter pics in the challenge. : )</td>', 'this is amusing. one of th ebetter pics in the challenge. : )', '2002-06-12 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71769, 2302, 772, '<td valign="top">i like toy cars :)</td>', 'i like toy cars :)', '2002-06-12 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71770, 2302, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the toy cars don''t work for me.</td>', 'Sorry, the toy cars don''t work for me.', '2002-06-12 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71771, 2302, 933, '<td valign="top">The only toy car photo which appealed to me.  Very nice job.</td>', 'The only toy car photo which appealed to me.  Very nice job.', '2002-06-13 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71772, 2302, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I think this is a great composition, how you have your line coming down at an angle, and you have the car towards the bottom with the extra space at the top.  I think normally I''d want more space in front of the vehicle to tell me where you are going, but somehow it just works out alright in this picture.  Maybe I''m just happy to see where it came from.</td>', 'I like it.  I think this is a great composition, how you have your line coming down at an angle, and you have the car towards the bottom with the extra space at the top.  I think normally I''d want more space in front of the vehicle to tell me where you are going, but somehow it just works out alright in this picture.  Maybe I''m just happy to see where it came from.', '2002-06-13 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71773, 2302, 1, '<td valign="top">nice dof, though the white/black looks like you''re emulating a street...i wouldve tried find a bigger model to put on the street... or maybe bike tire...otherwise the shot looks nice.</td>', 'nice dof, though the white/black looks like you''re emulating a street...i wouldve tried find a bigger model to put on the street... or maybe bike tire...otherwise the shot looks nice.', '2002-06-13 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71774, 2302, 1707, '<td valign="top">awesome black and white!  Brings out the car model''s decade</td>', 'awesome black and white!  Brings out the car model''s decade', '2002-06-14 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71775, 2302, 637, '<td valign="top">Well done, especially the loss of dof in the bkgd.</td>', 'Well done, especially the loss of dof in the bkgd.', '2002-06-15 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71776, 2303, 205, '<td valign="top">I it just me or do alot of people not like getting out of their car to take pictures?</td>', 'I it just me or do alot of people not like getting out of their car to take pictures?', '2002-06-10 06:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71777, 2303, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo... the title, however, is bringing a very minor part of the photo into question... I can barely see the mountains...  Anyway... I think that the auto mirror being visible in the right part of the frame is a slight distraction... I would have possibly considered cropping that out in this particular photo... or possibly having more of it in view :) Good work!</td>', 'Interesting photo... the title, however, is bringing a very minor part of the photo into question... I can barely see the mountains...  Anyway... I think that the auto mirror being visible in the right part of the frame is a slight distraction... I would have possibly considered cropping that out in this particular photo... or possibly having more of it in view :) Good work!', '2002-06-10 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71778, 2303, 1569, '<td valign="top">You should be a little closer to the mountains if you use them in the title.They are really lost in the pix.</td>', 'You should be a little closer to the mountains if you use them in the title.They are really lost in the pix.', '2002-06-10 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71779, 2303, 573, '<td valign="top">Out the window of a moving car, ok, you had to be ''On the Road'' to take this picture.</td>', 'Out the window of a moving car, ok, you had to be ''On the Road'' to take this picture.', '2002-06-10 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71780, 2303, 1944, '<td valign="top">nice snapshot</td>', 'nice snapshot', '2002-06-10 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71781, 2303, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I don''t know if it was intentional, but the gap in the trees really accents the mountains and seems to push the focus that way.  Ordinarily, power lines drive me sideways up a wall (no pun, of course), but these add to the "realness" of the picture.  It almost looks oversharpened to me, and if you could have done something about that blasted mirror, it would have been nicer.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I don''t know if it was intentional, but the gap in the trees really accents the mountains and seems to push the focus that way.  Ordinarily, power lines drive me sideways up a wall (no pun, of course), but these add to the "realness" of the picture.  It almost looks oversharpened to me, and if you could have done something about that blasted mirror, it would have been nicer.', '2002-06-10 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71782, 2303, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun road shot, pretty hills, far off.</td>', 'Fun road shot, pretty hills, far off.', '2002-06-10 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71783, 2303, 1543, '<td valign="top">great sky</td>', 'great sky', '2002-06-10 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71784, 2303, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety  4  interesting 4  focus 8  framing 5= 5</td>', 'creativety  4  interesting 4  focus 8  framing 5= 5', '2002-06-11 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71785, 2303, 1041, '<td valign="top">Yes.  I''m sorry, but I''m not very inspired by this shot.  Maybe even if there was traffic on the road.  And not the pole reflecting in the mirror.  I don''t know.</td>', 'Yes.  I''m sorry, but I''m not very inspired by this shot.  Maybe even if there was traffic on the road.  And not the pole reflecting in the mirror.  I don''t know.', '2002-06-11 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71786, 2303, 1882, '<td valign="top">was the mirror SUPPOSED to be in the shot?  Or what WAS the focal point of this pic?  I can''t see it.  The grass or the blurry road?  or the clouds?  Hmmm..</td>', 'was the mirror SUPPOSED to be in the shot?  Or what WAS the focal point of this pic?  I can''t see it.  The grass or the blurry road?  or the clouds?  Hmmm..', '2002-06-11 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71787, 2303, 1446, '<td valign="top">Cropping the rear view mirror out would have vastly improved this photograph.  Also using the RUT to eliminate the cut in half feeling of this photograph.  Nice focus ... Lots of great green.</td>', 'Cropping the rear view mirror out would have vastly improved this photograph.  Also using the RUT to eliminate the cut in half feeling of this photograph.  Nice focus ... Lots of great green.', '2002-06-11 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71788, 2303, 1759, '<td valign="top">I had some trouble finding the subject in this one. There is a road, a mirror, and way in the back some mountains, but nothing holding it all together and no visual clues to guide my eyes. The power lines are also a distraction. I wish all power lines were underground. It does look properly metered and has good color.</td>', 'I had some trouble finding the subject in this one. There is a road, a mirror, and way in the back some mountains, but nothing holding it all together and no visual clues to guide my eyes. The power lines are also a distraction. I wish all power lines were underground. It does look properly metered and has good color.', '2002-06-11 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71789, 2303, 1005, '<td valign="top">you call those mountains?  Nice photo, needs to be higher resolution, but not on this site.  Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 7</td>', 'you call those mountains?  Nice photo, needs to be higher resolution, but not on this site.  Photo 8 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 7', '2002-06-11 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71790, 2303, 1054, '<td valign="top">Greak clouds and sky in this, a crop of the mirror would have helped bring the focus out toward the main subject of the photo.  Also, I would have titled this differently as the mountains are difficult to see.</td>', 'Greak clouds and sky in this, a crop of the mirror would have helped bring the focus out toward the main subject of the photo.  Also, I would have titled this differently as the mountains are difficult to see.', '2002-06-12 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71791, 2303, 1037, '<td valign="top">The clouds lift this photo for me. Otherwise it would be very dull, I''m afraid.</td>', 'The clouds lift this photo for me. Otherwise it would be very dull, I''m afraid.', '2002-06-14 06:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71792, 2303, 472, '<td valign="top">yep. them are some serious mountains : P .. But Seriously, i hope you had a very nice time on your trip ... : )</td>', 'yep. them are some serious mountains : P .. But Seriously, i hope you had a very nice time on your trip ... : )', '2002-06-15 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71793, 2303, 2235, '<td valign="top">Need more center focus on mnts to meet with title. Plan shot with little if not center of interest. Too cluttered. Nothing to really draw eye.</td>', 'Need more center focus on mnts to meet with title. Plan shot with little if not center of interest. Too cluttered. Nothing to really draw eye.', '2002-06-16 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71794, 2303, 1, '<td valign="top">Eh.  Seems real spur of the moment snap shot, you can barely see the mountains.</td>', 'Eh.  Seems real spur of the moment snap shot, you can barely see the mountains.', '2002-06-17 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71795, 2304, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo isn''t bad but the sign seems to be the subject of the photo... I can see the oncoming headlights in the darkness but the road is barely visible.  I believe that this photo would be a much stronger interpretation of this challenge if it was just the car on the road...  The sign being the major part of the foreground in this photo makes the oncoming headlights seem like a minor extra detail in the photo.  In my humble opinion, the subject of the photo should be a strong interpretation of the challenge topic...</td>', 'This photo isn''t bad but the sign seems to be the subject of the photo... I can see the oncoming headlights in the darkness but the road is barely visible.  I believe that this photo would be a much stronger interpretation of this challenge if it was just the car on the road...  The sign being the major part of the foreground in this photo makes the oncoming headlights seem like a minor extra detail in the photo.  In my humble opinion, the subject of the photo should be a strong interpretation of the challenge topic...', '2002-06-10 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71796, 2304, 1041, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, your shot lacks focus, and the pole is not straight.  Too much dark space.</td>', 'Unfortunately, your shot lacks focus, and the pole is not straight.  Too much dark space.', '2002-06-10 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71797, 2304, 2075, '<td valign="top">First thing, this seems to be more of an ad for "Green Acres Nursery" than what the challenge is. Second, it seems to be a bit blurred to me. The lights are evident on the vehicle but it is very hard to distinguish the surroundings because of the darkness of the image.</td>', 'First thing, this seems to be more of an ad for "Green Acres Nursery" than what the challenge is. Second, it seems to be a bit blurred to me. The lights are evident on the vehicle but it is very hard to distinguish the surroundings because of the darkness of the image.', '2002-06-10 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71798, 2304, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun work.</td>', 'Fun work.', '2002-06-10 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71799, 2304, 1759, '<td valign="top">I don''t mean to be picky, but I don''t quite get the connection, but maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'I don''t mean to be picky, but I don''t quite get the connection, but maybe it''s just me.', '2002-06-10 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71800, 2304, 1877, '<td valign="top">Just looks like a sign to me.. sorry</td>', 'Just looks like a sign to me.. sorry', '2002-06-11 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71801, 2304, 573, '<td valign="top">Looks like a "were open all night ad." nice fraining and exposure under difficult lighting conditions.</td>', 'Looks like a "were open all night ad." nice fraining and exposure under difficult lighting conditions.', '2002-06-11 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71802, 2304, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety  2  interesting 3  focus 3  framing 5 = 4</td>', 'creativety  2  interesting 3  focus 3  framing 5 = 4', '2002-06-11 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71803, 2304, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is not an especially compelling subject, and there''s too much glare on the sign.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is not an especially compelling subject, and there''s too much glare on the sign.', '2002-06-12 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71804, 2304, 811, '<td valign="top">Since the sign seems to be the focal point of your picture (it is lit up the brightest, and is the biggest object), it would make more sense to me if it were a motel, or inn, or something.  The solitary headlights do add a "lonesome" touch to the picture.</td>', 'Since the sign seems to be the focal point of your picture (it is lit up the brightest, and is the biggest object), it would make more sense to me if it were a motel, or inn, or something.  The solitary headlights do add a "lonesome" touch to the picture.', '2002-06-15 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71805, 2304, 472, '<td valign="top">gotta get me some baby plants - in the middle of the night!  : )  seriously, a nice pic.</td>', 'gotta get me some baby plants - in the middle of the night!  : )  seriously, a nice pic.', '2002-06-15 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71806, 2304, 1, '<td valign="top">Slightly uninteresting subject.</td>', 'Slightly uninteresting subject.', '2002-06-17 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71807, 2309, 205, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting perspective.</td>', 'This is a very interesting perspective.', '2002-06-10 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71808, 2309, 1, '<td valign="top">Great such with such potential -- I''d like to see a more blackened tire though, you should have cleaned it off first, it would''ve been much dramatic and contrasty.</td>', 'Great such with such potential -- I''d like to see a more blackened tire though, you should have cleaned it off first, it would''ve been much dramatic and contrasty.', '2002-06-10 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71809, 2309, 885, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Not sure if I''d have liked it better with the road more in focus, but I think it works well out of focus also.  I like the diagonal composition.</td>', 'I like this.  Not sure if I''d have liked it better with the road more in focus, but I think it works well out of focus also.  I like the diagonal composition.', '2002-06-10 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71810, 2309, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings... You have an interesting photo here... Let me try my hand at critique:<br/><br/>Framing and composition:  I don''t see any real issues in the framing or coposition of this photo.  I believe that what I see here is exactly what you intended for me to see :)  <br/><br/>Image quality:  There are a few things that I may have done if this photo was mine... I think I would have rinsed off the tire with a water hose and wet the ground underneath the tire... the wet pavement underneath the tire would have darkened up the surface some and eliminated the HOT spots in this photo, possibly.  <br/><br/>Subjectivity:  I''m not sure that this particular subject is very appealing to *me*.  However, the photograph of the subject is not bad at all :)<br/><br/></td>', 'Greetings... You have an interesting photo here... Let me try my hand at critique:Framing and composition:  I don''t see any real issues in the framing or coposition of this photo.  I believe that what I see here is exactly what you intended for me to see :)  Image quality:  There are a few things that I may have done if this photo was mine... I think I would have rinsed off the tire with a water hose and wet the ground underneath the tire... the wet pavement underneath the tire would have darkened up the surface some and eliminated the HOT spots in this photo, possibly.  Subjectivity:  I''m not sure that this particular subject is very appealing to *me*.  However, the photograph of the subject is not bad at all :)', '2002-06-10 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71811, 2309, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, well done.', '2002-06-10 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(71812, 2309, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot... I like it.</td>', 'Nice macro shot... I like it.', '2002-06-10 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1);
