(71913, 2313, 1005, '<td valign="top">With the window rolled up, extra point, and driving too, good trick.  You are in a Pick Up with a bed liner.  (i.e. wasting time trying to figure out what to say.)<br/>I really like this effect, too bad you couldn''t "play" with it more.  The sun is much more indistinct than the other sun shot in this challenge.  Sky colors are a bit unworldly, pink/yellow, does make the shot more interesting. Too bad you could wipe out the junk around the mirror (far background stuff).<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 9</td>', 'With the window rolled up, extra point, and driving too, good trick.  You are in a Pick Up with a bed liner.  (i.e. wasting time trying to figure out what to say.)I really like this effect, too bad you couldn''t "play" with it more.  The sun is much more indistinct than the other sun shot in this challenge.  Sky colors are a bit unworldly, pink/yellow, does make the shot more interesting. Too bad you could wipe out the junk around the mirror (far background stuff).Photo 9 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 9', '2002-06-10 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
