(72067, 2325, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colours are very muddy. Playing with the levels would help.</td>', 'The colours are very muddy. Playing with the levels would help.', '2002-06-16 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72068, 2325, 1175, '<td valign="top">Your model is not very attractive, and even if its done purposefully will make people want to give you a lower score.  Now just putting that aside it looks like you shot this with a small f-stop (f11or the likes) and you just put everything in focus.  Your subject though is the highhiker so it probably would have been better if the cars passing by where out of focus.  Also, you don''t want your subject to be smack dab in the middle.  You should have had him turn his body 45 degrees so that he''s partially facing the road on the right and then you should have framed him more to the left.</td>', 'Your model is not very attractive, and even if its done purposefully will make people want to give you a lower score.  Now just putting that aside it looks like you shot this with a small f-stop (f11or the likes) and you just put everything in focus.  Your subject though is the highhiker so it probably would have been better if the cars passing by where out of focus.  Also, you don''t want your subject to be smack dab in the middle.  You should have had him turn his body 45 degrees so that he''s partially facing the road on the right and then you should have framed him more to the left.', '2002-06-16 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72069, 2325, 1863, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that this guy is a bit larger than average does NOT take away from the picture. I do not like that people are voting it down cause of the guy. I think he''s lovely and brave. I gave this picture a 9 mainly because of the humor, and the brightness. I think it works. Carry on the good work.<br/>-Annida</td>', 'I think the fact that this guy is a bit larger than average does NOT take away from the picture. I do not like that people are voting it down cause of the guy. I think he''s lovely and brave. I gave this picture a 9 mainly because of the humor, and the brightness. I think it works. Carry on the good work.-Annida', '2002-06-17 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72070, 2325, 1041, '<td valign="top">Annida, I agree with you, all those personal comments are uncalled for.  Having said that, if you read the other half of the comments that remark on the execution of the photo, you''ll see that many people also felt that there were several major flaws in this shot, and it didn''t deserve high ratings with or w/out the topless guy.</td>', 'Annida, I agree with you, all those personal comments are uncalled for.  Having said that, if you read the other half of the comments that remark on the execution of the photo, you''ll see that many people also felt that there were several major flaws in this shot, and it didn''t deserve high ratings with or w/out the topless guy.', '2002-06-17 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72071, 2326, 1944, '<td valign="top">looks like an interesting place.</td>', 'looks like an interesting place.', '2002-06-10 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
