(72092, 2328, 1005, '<td valign="top">sky is washed out.  i am looking for a turorial to fix this issue. haze filter would have helped, too.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 6</td>', 'sky is washed out.  i am looking for a turorial to fix this issue. haze filter would have helped, too.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 6', '2002-06-11 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72093, 2328, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice mountain shot.... there is a road in front of it so this qualifies for ''on the road'' :)</td>', 'Nice mountain shot.... there is a road in front of it so this qualifies for ''on the road'' :)', '2002-06-12 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72094, 2328, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Too bad the sky wasnt clearer. If it was all bet the red in the mountain and the blue sky would have been stunning!</td>', 'Nice job. Too bad the sky wasnt clearer. If it was all bet the red in the mountain and the blue sky would have been stunning!', '2002-06-12 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72095, 2328, 1041, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not very inspired by this one.  In this light, the mountain doesn''t look red (what would this have looked like at sunrise/sunset?) and your horizon doesn''t seem totally level.  And the picture isn''t much about the road.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not very inspired by this one.  In this light, the mountain doesn''t look red (what would this have looked like at sunrise/sunset?) and your horizon doesn''t seem totally level.  And the picture isn''t much about the road.', '2002-06-12 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72096, 2328, 1054, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen a lower angle on this shot, with the horizon abover center and the mountains about 1/3 of the way down from the top.</td>', 'I would like to have seen a lower angle on this shot, with the horizon abover center and the mountains about 1/3 of the way down from the top.', '2002-06-13 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72097, 2328, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the haze of this shot, but I think it might be more effective if the camera was shot from a position closer to the road.</td>', 'I like the haze of this shot, but I think it might be more effective if the camera was shot from a position closer to the road.', '2002-06-13 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72098, 2328, 1897, '<td valign="top">This would be better taken in the evening, like "into the night"</td>', 'This would be better taken in the evening, like "into the night"', '2002-06-13 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
