(72100, 2328, 1037, '<td valign="top">The mountains are great, but this photo could do with some post processing work to bring out the colours a bit more. Just some work on the levels would improve it a lot.</td>', 'The mountains are great, but this photo could do with some post processing work to bring out the colours a bit more. Just some work on the levels would improve it a lot.', '2002-06-15 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
