(72130, 2329, 1202, '<td valign="top">I just changed my vote on this one, and up too.   It is a great shot with good color, excellent detail,and fits the category.   Shallow DOF works well here also.   Now I know why I couldn''t do one like this, you had my toad.</td>', 'I just changed my vote on this one, and up too.   It is a great shot with good color, excellent detail,and fits the category.   Shallow DOF works well here also.   Now I know why I couldn''t do one like this, you had my toad.', '2002-06-13 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
