(72151, 2330, 772, '<td valign="top">Is this a brick road?  if so, there''s not enough of it showing to let me know that it''s a road.  Where I am from, we don''t have brick roads and I only see brick like this on an occasional crosswalk possibly.   The photo graph in itself is very interesting but i think it''s a weak interpretation of the challenge topic...</td>', 'Is this a brick road?  if so, there''s not enough of it showing to let me know that it''s a road.  Where I am from, we don''t have brick roads and I only see brick like this on an occasional crosswalk possibly.   The photo graph in itself is very interesting but i think it''s a weak interpretation of the challenge topic...', '2002-06-10 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72152, 2330, 737, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the title. Great photo, though. I''ll look at this again. I''m not sure if this is a road, or a sidewalk.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the title. Great photo, though. I''ll look at this again. I''m not sure if this is a road, or a sidewalk.', '2002-06-10 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
