(72154, 2330, 387, '<td valign="top">I think the idea behind this photo was good. If possible the photographer should have gotten lower to the ground to maximize the reflection. A polarizer would have helped a great deal also. The red thing in the middle of the reflection is a HUGE distraction. Another thing to maximize the contrast in the reflection. . .late afternoon or early morning light.</td>', 'I think the idea behind this photo was good. If possible the photographer should have gotten lower to the ground to maximize the reflection. A polarizer would have helped a great deal also. The red thing in the middle of the reflection is a HUGE distraction. Another thing to maximize the contrast in the reflection. . .late afternoon or early morning light.', '2002-06-10 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72155, 2330, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very well composed photo. You''ll probably be getting some comments from those who can''t physically see a road, but that''s their problem.</td>', 'Very well composed photo. You''ll probably be getting some comments from those who can''t physically see a road, but that''s their problem.', '2002-06-10 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
