(72161, 2330, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections.  Different take on the challenge.  Good job.  It was probably not possible to avoid having the traffic light there, and you may have wanted it in the shot to tie this more to the challenge topic, but I find it distracting.  It draws my eye away from the reflection and the color clashes with the rest of the more muted tones (and, yes, I know you can''t just change the colors they use for traffic lights ;)</td>', 'Nice reflections.  Different take on the challenge.  Good job.  It was probably not possible to avoid having the traffic light there, and you may have wanted it in the shot to tie this more to the challenge topic, but I find it distracting.  It draws my eye away from the reflection and the color clashes with the rest of the more muted tones (and, yes, I know you can''t just change the colors they use for traffic lights ;)', '2002-06-12 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72162, 2330, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection of the traffic light in the puddle.</td>', 'I love the reflection of the traffic light in the puddle.', '2002-06-13 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
