(72183, 2331, 327, '<td valign="top">Totally cool work. Creative, fine work. I know white is cheap, but would of been cool with several colors also. I like this very much........!!!</td>', 'Totally cool work. Creative, fine work. I know white is cheap, but would of been cool with several colors also. I like this very much........!!!', '2002-06-10 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72184, 2331, 1078, '<td valign="top">Cheater!  :-)  I don''t entirely get the oil paint and spatula in terms of the photo as a whole, but I like it anyway.  I wish there was some way to make the change from road to print/painting/whatever a little less distinct -- kind of like you did with the rip along the top (I didn''t recognize that those were real clouds and not part of the print for quite some time).  But even with the obvious division between the two, I like the way this works.  Well done.</td>', 'Cheater!  :-)  I don''t entirely get the oil paint and spatula in terms of the photo as a whole, but I like it anyway.  I wish there was some way to make the change from road to print/painting/whatever a little less distinct -- kind of like you did with the rip along the top (I didn''t recognize that those were real clouds and not part of the print for quite some time).  But even with the obvious division between the two, I like the way this works.  Well done.', '2002-06-10 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72185, 2331, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very interesting... quite artistic</td>', 'Very interesting... quite artistic', '2002-06-10 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
