(72194, 2331, 573, '<td valign="top">You''ve got my attention, is that realy how they make the white line down the middle of the road?  And all this time I thought it came out of a machine.  This is one of my top ten on creativity alone.</td>', 'You''ve got my attention, is that realy how they make the white line down the middle of the road?  And all this time I thought it came out of a machine.  This is one of my top ten on creativity alone.', '2002-06-11 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
