(72197, 2331, 1759, '<td valign="top">I think this to be perhaps the most original shot for this challenge. Nicely executed, interesting, and unique plus it has good color, saturation, composition, contrast, focus, and lighting. Very good indeed!</td>', 'I think this to be perhaps the most original shot for this challenge. Nicely executed, interesting, and unique plus it has good color, saturation, composition, contrast, focus, and lighting. Very good indeed!', '2002-06-11 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
