(72200, 2331, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Took me a minute to figure this out.  What I''m getting is a printed out photo, ripped at the top, put on a real road, with real sky behind it.  With while paint and a putty knife suggesting that the road in the picture extends out into the real road.  Neat idea.  I wonder if a paint brush would have been more effective in conveying that you''re painting that line though.</td>', 'Interesting.  Took me a minute to figure this out.  What I''m getting is a printed out photo, ripped at the top, put on a real road, with real sky behind it.  With while paint and a putty knife suggesting that the road in the picture extends out into the real road.  Neat idea.  I wonder if a paint brush would have been more effective in conveying that you''re painting that line though.', '2002-06-12 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72201, 2331, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot. How did you do it!</td>', 'This is a cool shot. How did you do it!', '2002-06-12 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72202, 2331, 472, '<td valign="top">this cracks me up. i love the set you''ve built. i bet i know who shot this, too ; ) .. one of my 5 best.</td>', 'this cracks me up. i love the set you''ve built. i bet i know who shot this, too ; ) .. one of my 5 best.', '2002-06-12 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72203, 2331, 1054, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, but this one feels too setup to me.</td>', 'The composition is good, but this one feels too setup to me.', '2002-06-12 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72204, 2331, 933, '<td valign="top">I f*ing love this photo!!  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  My only knock is that the blue on the camel picture seems kinda noisy.  I think by easing off on the compression, and letting the file size slip up to 150k, you could have produces a cleaner image.  Otherwise very very creative, excellent work!</td>', 'I f*ing love this photo!!  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  My only knock is that the blue on the camel picture seems kinda noisy.  I think by easing off on the compression, and letting the file size slip up to 150k, you could have produces a cleaner image.  Otherwise very very creative, excellent work!', '2002-06-13 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72205, 2331, 2111, '<td valign="top">how did u do this?! 8</td>', 'how did u do this?! 8', '2002-06-13 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72206, 2331, 89, '<td valign="top">im bemused and perplexed!</td>', 'im bemused and perplexed!', '2002-06-13 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
