(72209, 2331, 1122, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of this photo!<br/>Especially the hot steam that makes the background blur.<br/>Was the road really that hot?<br/>Or did you add some effect afterwards? (9)</td>', 'I like the feeling of this photo!Especially the hot steam that makes the background blur.Was the road really that hot?Or did you add some effect afterwards? (9)', '2002-06-14 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
