(72231, 2332, 509, '<td valign="top">Very good rustic quality.  I like the sun reflecting off the road, though it doesn''t seem to flow right with the greenery.</td>', 'Very good rustic quality.  I like the sun reflecting off the road, though it doesn''t seem to flow right with the greenery.', '2002-06-13 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
