(72315, 2337, 1759, '<td valign="top">This looks like a somewhat hurried shot so the composition isn''t ideal. Obviously the lighting isn''t ideal either, but you did a really good job of having just the right shutter speed to give a sense of action. You might try tighter cropping, lopping off the left and bottom. You might also get some improvement by increasing the gamma.</td>', 'This looks like a somewhat hurried shot so the composition isn''t ideal. Obviously the lighting isn''t ideal either, but you did a really good job of having just the right shutter speed to give a sense of action. You might try tighter cropping, lopping off the left and bottom. You might also get some improvement by increasing the gamma.', '2002-06-10 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
