(72329, 2337, 47, '<td valign="top">jamiepattee - 6/13/2002<br/>Where''s THE ROAD???????????<br/><br/>good one, hypocrite. maybe you''ve never had to pronounce words out loud before, but try these two: road. rodeo. moreover, ''hit the road'' probably derives somewhere from american western culture, and ill be damned if we rode out to california in cars.<br/><br/>granted, it is indescribably, painfully cheesy. that doesnt mean you have to be a retard, and im not going to sit here and watch morons get away with shit while i get the can because drew doesnt like unhappy thoughts</td>', 'jamiepattee - 6/13/2002Where''s THE ROAD???????????good one, hypocrite. maybe you''ve never had to pronounce words out loud before, but try these two: road. rodeo. moreover, ''hit the road'' probably derives somewhere from american western culture, and ill be damned if we rode out to california in cars.granted, it is indescribably, painfully cheesy. that doesnt mean you have to be a retard, and im not going to sit here and watch morons get away with shit while i get the can because drew doesnt like unhappy thoughts', '2002-06-21 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
