(72337, 2339, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but doesn''t fully do it for me. I think there are two things going on here. First, the background destracts from the crossroads. I cropped from the top and right side and thought it worked better. Secondly, it would be nice to have something else in the photo, ideally a horse drawn carriage coming up to the intersection. Of course, we can''t easily pull one of those out of our bag now can we? sigh... I really like the almost surreal look of the road and foilage. It has a nice mood created by the angle and the lighting on the bushes near the crossroads.</td>', 'This is nice, but doesn''t fully do it for me. I think there are two things going on here. First, the background destracts from the crossroads. I cropped from the top and right side and thought it worked better. Secondly, it would be nice to have something else in the photo, ideally a horse drawn carriage coming up to the intersection. Of course, we can''t easily pull one of those out of our bag now can we? sigh... I really like the almost surreal look of the road and foilage. It has a nice mood created by the angle and the lighting on the bushes near the crossroads.', '2002-06-10 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
