(72354, 2340, 1005, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.  I like the color saturation, really eye catching, but maybe over the top.  Digital editing has a price, it''s almost always image quality (pixelation).  Was the original photo as grainy as this?  I doubt it.  Look at the lamp posts, in places they disappear, not good.  <br/>Photo 5 Creativity 10 Road 8 total 8</td>', 'Powerful image.  I like the color saturation, really eye catching, but maybe over the top.  Digital editing has a price, it''s almost always image quality (pixelation).  Was the original photo as grainy as this?  I doubt it.  Look at the lamp posts, in places they disappear, not good.  Photo 5 Creativity 10 Road 8 total 8', '2002-06-10 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72355, 2340, 1009, '<td valign="top">I very much like the saturation of this picture... good job. Nice framing too.</td>', 'I very much like the saturation of this picture... good job. Nice framing too.', '2002-06-10 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72356, 2340, 737, '<td valign="top">Too grainy and blown out for my tastes.</td>', 'Too grainy and blown out for my tastes.', '2002-06-10 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72357, 2340, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the way the over saturation conveys the title.</td>', 'I like the way the over saturation conveys the title.', '2002-06-10 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72358, 2340, 1877, '<td valign="top">Are we allowed to do this with the colors? But it''s pretty cool.. I can see this being used for a traffic page for a website of a news station or something. Also it reminds me of summer.. hot.. sticking to the seats while you wait in traffic.. AUGH! :) Good pic</td>', 'Are we allowed to do this with the colors? But it''s pretty cool.. I can see this being used for a traffic page for a website of a news station or something. Also it reminds me of summer.. hot.. sticking to the seats while you wait in traffic.. AUGH! :) Good pic', '2002-06-11 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72359, 2340, 714, '<td valign="top">creativety  5     interesting  7    focus  8    framing   7 =   7</td>', 'creativety  5     interesting  7    focus  8    framing   7 =   7', '2002-06-11 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72360, 2340, 2094, '<td valign="top">While the quality of the image is somewhat poor, the composition and colors of the shot make up for it. The title is spot on, the image really does give off a feeling of frustration.</td>', 'While the quality of the image is somewhat poor, the composition and colors of the shot make up for it. The title is spot on, the image really does give off a feeling of frustration.', '2002-06-11 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72361, 2340, 573, '<td valign="top">Me too, every work day.  I don''t want to look at it any more even if it is artisticly over saturated.</td>', 'Me too, every work day.  I don''t want to look at it any more even if it is artisticly over saturated.', '2002-06-11 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72362, 2340, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, man, do I know how that feels!  I like this photo - breaking the rules works here.</td>', 'Oh, man, do I know how that feels!  I like this photo - breaking the rules works here.', '2002-06-11 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72363, 2340, 89, '<td valign="top">Overexposure and color bleed does not make this scene look any more interesting.</td>', 'Overexposure and color bleed does not make this scene look any more interesting.', '2002-06-11 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72364, 2340, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice use of camera angle and oversaturation to convey a mood.</td>', 'Nice use of camera angle and oversaturation to convey a mood.', '2002-06-11 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
