(72367, 2340, 885, '<td valign="top">I do like the tilt.  The colors and levels are extreme...I like it, but I might like it better less extreme</td>', 'I do like the tilt.  The colors and levels are extreme...I like it, but I might like it better less extreme', '2002-06-12 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72368, 2340, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the grain and angle... I feel like I have my head tilted out the window to look down the line of traffic on a hot, hazy day.</td>', 'Nice use of the grain and angle... I feel like I have my head tilted out the window to look down the line of traffic on a hot, hazy day.', '2002-06-12 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72369, 2340, 472, '<td valign="top">ah, you''re not from the DC area, are you? ; ) <br/><br/>the hyper saturated colors, I can''t tell if they add or detract.  I think they add.</td>', 'ah, you''re not from the DC area, are you? ; ) the hyper saturated colors, I can''t tell if they add or detract.  I think they add.', '2002-06-13 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72370, 2340, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the tilted angle of this and the colors are cool. 9 :)</td>', 'I like the tilted angle of this and the colors are cool. 9 :)', '2002-06-13 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72371, 2340, 772, '<td valign="top">I do get a feeling of frustration from this photograph :)  I think the harsh coloring and whatever filters or editing that has been applied does a very nice job of conveying the feeling and frustrations of being stuck in traffic... great shot!</td>', 'I do get a feeling of frustration from this photograph :)  I think the harsh coloring and whatever filters or editing that has been applied does a very nice job of conveying the feeling and frustrations of being stuck in traffic... great shot!', '2002-06-13 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72372, 2340, 811, '<td valign="top">Normally, colors like this annoy me, but I think it helps to set the mood for this picture.  I''m sure others have nailed you on it, though.  I think it gives it a surreal effect, though.</td>', 'Normally, colors like this annoy me, but I think it helps to set the mood for this picture.  I''m sure others have nailed you on it, though.  I think it gives it a surreal effect, though.', '2002-06-13 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72373, 2340, 1379, '<td valign="top">I feel it!  Your decision to tweak the colors really adds to the feeling of AUGGGH!</td>', 'I feel it!  Your decision to tweak the colors really adds to the feeling of AUGGGH!', '2002-06-13 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72374, 2340, 1658, '<td valign="top">This photo keep creeping up in scoring with me, because the more I looked at it, the more i realized how well it conveys exactly what you''ve titled it... frustration.  Well done.</td>', 'This photo keep creeping up in scoring with me, because the more I looked at it, the more i realized how well it conveys exactly what you''ve titled it... frustration.  Well done.', '2002-06-14 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72375, 2340, 1037, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy, but I like the way you took the photo at this angle and pushed up the colours to make the feeling of frustration more tangible.</td>', 'A bit grainy, but I like the way you took the photo at this angle and pushed up the colours to make the feeling of frustration more tangible.', '2002-06-14 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72376, 2340, 2126, '<td valign="top">How many times have I seen this view! I like the style - it makes a dull subject seem intersting (especially the truck)</td>', 'How many times have I seen this view! I like the style - it makes a dull subject seem intersting (especially the truck)', '2002-06-15 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72377, 2340, 1831, '<td valign="top">Like the post editing, My kind of photo."9" Nah stuff it "10" good job ;-)</td>', 'Like the post editing, My kind of photo."9" Nah stuff it "10" good job ;-)', '2002-06-15 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72378, 2340, 2235, '<td valign="top">Creative shot. Use of off angle adds impact to this photo. I prefer sharp photos as a rule but this effect works for me with this photo with use of grain.</td>', 'Creative shot. Use of off angle adds impact to this photo. I prefer sharp photos as a rule but this effect works for me with this photo with use of grain.', '2002-06-16 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72379, 2340, 2153, '<td valign="top">I really like this pic. The colors are glaring and the angle gives it a nice line. I can almost hear the horns... This has alot of impact and the title is great.</td>', 'I really like this pic. The colors are glaring and the angle gives it a nice line. I can almost hear the horns... This has alot of impact and the title is great.', '2002-06-18 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72380, 2341, 1, '<td valign="top">To have the focus be on the road, I think the shot needs to be landscape or cropped tighter.</td>', 'To have the focus be on the road, I think the shot needs to be landscape or cropped tighter.', '2002-06-10 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72381, 2341, 2, '<td valign="top">You seem to be just a little crooked -- leaning to the right.  The only other problem I see is that the picture is slightly grainy -- either camera image quality or wrong camera settings.</td>', 'You seem to be just a little crooked -- leaning to the right.  The only other problem I see is that the picture is slightly grainy -- either camera image quality or wrong camera settings.', '2002-06-10 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
