(72387, 2341, 1041, '<td valign="top">Home in the country - lucky you!  The shot doesn''t look quite straight though, I''d crop out the little bit of tree on the right, and while I like the use of ROT, I would probably show 2/3 road 1/3 sky since this is supposed to be about the road.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Home in the country - lucky you!  The shot doesn''t look quite straight though, I''d crop out the little bit of tree on the right, and while I like the use of ROT, I would probably show 2/3 road 1/3 sky since this is supposed to be about the road.  Just my opinion.', '2002-06-11 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
