(72396, 2341, 1054, '<td valign="top">I think a lower angle (horizon higher in the frame) would have been more interesting.</td>', 'I think a lower angle (horizon higher in the frame) would have been more interesting.', '2002-06-13 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
