(72401, 2342, 885, '<td valign="top">Really confusing.  I can''t make out how the mirror is relfecting the front view, cause that bus is going in the same direction, isn''t it?</td>', 'Really confusing.  I can''t make out how the mirror is relfecting the front view, cause that bus is going in the same direction, isn''t it?', '2002-06-10 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
