(72430, 2343, 1175, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it might have been better to get less of the interior of the car.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it might have been better to get less of the interior of the car.', '2002-06-16 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
