(72551, 2349, 472, '<td valign="top">boy, i dont understand what people are so hung up about.  well, i thought it was funny and i gave it a 5.  i think it would have been a better photo frmo closer or a low angle.</td>', 'boy, i dont understand what people are so hung up about.  well, i thought it was funny and i gave it a 5.  i think it would have been a better photo frmo closer or a low angle.', '2002-06-17 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
