(72555, 2350, 1175, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Looks like you may have had some file compression problems or something or maybe your image was a little blurry and you used to much sharpening because your truck has alot of jagged edges.</td>', 'Nice shot. Looks like you may have had some file compression problems or something or maybe your image was a little blurry and you used to much sharpening because your truck has alot of jagged edges.', '2002-06-10 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
