(72558, 2350, 573, '<td valign="top">Makes me wish I was out 4-Wheeling insted of rating photographs.</td>', 'Makes me wish I was out 4-Wheeling insted of rating photographs.', '2002-06-11 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72559, 2350, 878, '<td valign="top">Thats a good one</td>', 'Thats a good one', '2002-06-11 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72560, 2350, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of objects in the photo.  Good use of ROT.  Subject matter doesn''t totally inspire me, unfortunately.</td>', 'Nice placement of objects in the photo.  Good use of ROT.  Subject matter doesn''t totally inspire me, unfortunately.', '2002-06-12 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72561, 2350, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the toy cars don''t work for me.</td>', 'Sorry, the toy cars don''t work for me.', '2002-06-12 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72562, 2350, 255, '<td valign="top">i dig the framing and the DOF in this--i just don''t know if it is slightly out of focus or just heavily compressed, tho it looks like you had the right idea!</td>', 'i dig the framing and the DOF in this--i just don''t know if it is slightly out of focus or just heavily compressed, tho it looks like you had the right idea!', '2002-06-12 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72563, 2350, 472, '<td valign="top">lol. toys are fun, arent they.</td>', 'lol. toys are fun, arent they.', '2002-06-13 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72564, 2350, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors look a little dull on this end.  Also, it seems to be kinda "jaggy."  I do like the way you''ve focused the first one, and not the one behind.  It gives a sense of depth.</td>', 'The colors look a little dull on this end.  Also, it seems to be kinda "jaggy."  I do like the way you''ve focused the first one, and not the one behind.  It gives a sense of depth.', '2002-06-13 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72565, 2350, 1512, '<td valign="top">i race rc cars myself!!!! nice idea: 7/10</td>', 'i race rc cars myself!!!! nice idea: 7/10', '2002-06-14 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72566, 2350, 2093, '<td valign="top">pixelated...</td>', 'pixelated...', '2002-06-16 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72567, 2350, 1, '<td valign="top">Funny stuff, I''d rather see more DOF to have both vehicles in focus.</td>', 'Funny stuff, I''d rather see more DOF to have both vehicles in focus.', '2002-06-17 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72568, 2354, 1897, '<td valign="top">Powerlines!  Not very sharp either.</td>', 'Powerlines!  Not very sharp either.', '2002-06-10 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72569, 2354, 656, '<td valign="top">telephone/ power lines always ruin these shots - it can be hard to isolate them though...</td>', 'telephone/ power lines always ruin these shots - it can be hard to isolate them though...', '2002-06-10 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72570, 2354, 1569, '<td valign="top">Oh those nasty powerlines!! Double whammy--if you cropped them out you miss the neat clouds.</td>', 'Oh those nasty powerlines!! Double whammy--if you cropped them out you miss the neat clouds.', '2002-06-10 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72571, 2354, 772, '<td valign="top">Another nice sunset, but the ''road'' is not really visible.  if this wasn''t an ''on the road'' challenge, i would probalby not have noticed the road here without the title of this photo...</td>', 'Another nice sunset, but the ''road'' is not really visible.  if this wasn''t an ''on the road'' challenge, i would probalby not have noticed the road here without the title of this photo...', '2002-06-10 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72572, 2354, 1944, '<td valign="top">nice sunset.</td>', 'nice sunset.', '2002-06-10 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72573, 2354, 327, '<td valign="top">Dang nice work. Little over exposed ?? UV filter might of helped but his is pretty.</td>', 'Dang nice work. Little over exposed ?? UV filter might of helped but his is pretty.', '2002-06-10 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72574, 2354, 1005, '<td valign="top">RRREAlly Nice color!  Strong effect!  Too bad about the telephone lines.  You are getting alot of "noise" in the clouds and the sun''s flare, did you crank up the red values?  If so, there is always an impact/trade off in digital dark room editing, this would be the evidence of it.  Try experimenting with your exposure levels, if you didn''t already.   You might be able to get this effect without the extra edit.  (mind you, I am just guessing at what I am seeing, you could have a lower end camera that would produce some of the same graininess.)  Photo 6 Creativity 8 Road 8 total 8 (I would have given you 1 less for grainy, but I really like this shot.)</td>', 'RRREAlly Nice color!  Strong effect!  Too bad about the telephone lines.  You are getting alot of "noise" in the clouds and the sun''s flare, did you crank up the red values?  If so, there is always an impact/trade off in digital dark room editing, this would be the evidence of it.  Try experimenting with your exposure levels, if you didn''t already.   You might be able to get this effect without the extra edit.  (mind you, I am just guessing at what I am seeing, you could have a lower end camera that would produce some of the same graininess.)  Photo 6 Creativity 8 Road 8 total 8 (I would have given you 1 less for grainy, but I really like this shot.)', '2002-06-10 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72575, 2354, 1759, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and nice composition. I do wish all wiring were underground.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and nice composition. I do wish all wiring were underground.', '2002-06-10 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72576, 2354, 1962, '<td valign="top">wonderful color!</td>', 'wonderful color!', '2002-06-11 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72577, 2354, 121, '<td valign="top">nice sunset but if you hadn''t given it that title I might not have noticed that there was a road in the shot, it could be a field or anything.</td>', 'nice sunset but if you hadn''t given it that title I might not have noticed that there was a road in the shot, it could be a field or anything.', '2002-06-11 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72578, 2354, 573, '<td valign="top">I realy like the color of this sunset.</td>', 'I realy like the color of this sunset.', '2002-06-11 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72579, 2354, 1313, '<td valign="top">OK, a little dark though.</td>', 'OK, a little dark though.', '2002-06-11 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72580, 2354, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty photo. A beautiful sunset, love the color! Don''t you hate how power lines are everywhere? ;) It''s so hard to take sunrises and sunsets without them! I still gave you a high score, though. :)</td>', 'This is a pretty photo. A beautiful sunset, love the color! Don''t you hate how power lines are everywhere? ;) It''s so hard to take sunrises and sunsets without them! I still gave you a high score, though. :)', '2002-06-11 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72581, 2354, 1446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful skies, nice sunset.  The power lines across the top keep if from being perfect IMO.</td>', 'Beautiful skies, nice sunset.  The power lines across the top keep if from being perfect IMO.', '2002-06-12 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72582, 2354, 1135, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the road but the sunset is great!</td>', 'Hard to see the road but the sunset is great!', '2002-06-12 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72583, 2354, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great color and light range, but the shot is a bit grainy and the power lines are a distraction.</td>', 'Great color and light range, but the shot is a bit grainy and the power lines are a distraction.', '2002-06-12 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72584, 2354, 983, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent shot. Almost postcard perfect. Cloud contrast is a plus. My own opinion (and is just that MY opinion) is that it is a bit too pink/orange... like I said just my personal preference.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent shot. Almost postcard perfect. Cloud contrast is a plus. My own opinion (and is just that MY opinion) is that it is a bit too pink/orange... like I said just my personal preference.', '2002-06-13 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72585, 2354, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset (I''m a sucker for sunsets, I admit it).  Nice placement of sun in the side of the photo.  But you have to get your horizon straight.  It''s sloping to the left.  And even though it probably was impossible to avoid, the powerlines aren''t great, either.</td>', 'Nice sunset (I''m a sucker for sunsets, I admit it).  Nice placement of sun in the side of the photo.  But you have to get your horizon straight.  It''s sloping to the left.  And even though it probably was impossible to avoid, the powerlines aren''t great, either.', '2002-06-13 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72586, 2354, 472, '<td valign="top">nice sunset, although subject matter is a bit static (ie not particularly interesting).</td>', 'nice sunset, although subject matter is a bit static (ie not particularly interesting).', '2002-06-13 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72587, 2354, 637, '<td valign="top">Well done, but more a sunset shot than a "road" shot.</td>', 'Well done, but more a sunset shot than a "road" shot.', '2002-06-15 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72588, 2354, 2126, '<td valign="top">Nice. If the quality of the image was better, it would be very nice.</td>', 'Nice. If the quality of the image was better, it would be very nice.', '2002-06-15 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72589, 2354, 1, '<td valign="top">The sun is more of the subject, I can''t really see a road, just grass.</td>', 'The sun is more of the subject, I can''t really see a road, just grass.', '2002-06-16 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72590, 2355, 205, '<td valign="top">Corn with Marijuana?</td>', 'Corn with Marijuana?', '2002-06-10 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72591, 2355, 436, '<td valign="top">looks like corn to me</td>', 'looks like corn to me', '2002-06-10 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72592, 2355, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the flag! What a hoot. Cool.</td>', 'Love the flag! What a hoot. Cool.', '2002-06-10 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72593, 2355, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it should have had a little more depth of field. I would have liked to see the field sharp too.</td>', 'Nice picture, but it should have had a little more depth of field. I would have liked to see the field sharp too.', '2002-06-10 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72594, 2355, 173, '<td valign="top">They''re growing a little ''Americana'' baby!</td>', 'They''re growing a little ''Americana'' baby!', '2002-06-11 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72595, 2355, 1882, '<td valign="top">the tree blocking the tractor is very distracting and the whole picture looks a little out of focus</td>', 'the tree blocking the tractor is very distracting and the whole picture looks a little out of focus', '2002-06-11 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72596, 2355, 772, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a John Deere tractor, I still like the photo (I work for Caterpillar :) - I REALLY wish there would have been a possibility of NOT having this tree in front of the tractor.  I believe that the tree grabbed your camera''s attention for the focus and left the tractor a littly shy of good sharp focus... Your photo concept is great and I love the theme... Good shot!</td>', 'Even though this is a John Deere tractor, I still like the photo (I work for Caterpillar :) - I REALLY wish there would have been a possibility of NOT having this tree in front of the tractor.  I believe that the tree grabbed your camera''s attention for the focus and left the tractor a littly shy of good sharp focus... Your photo concept is great and I love the theme... Good shot!', '2002-06-12 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72597, 2355, 1041, '<td valign="top">Not sure how much this is about the road vs. the field, and would like to see it a little sharper (sharpening should be the last thing you do after all your adjustments, including resize.  You''d be amazed what a difference that makes to your shot.  I like how the tractor is partially hidding behind the trees and the yellow wheel and the red attachment are poking through.  Placement according to the rule of third (with the tractor on the right side and road in front of it to drive on) would''ve been even better.</td>', 'Not sure how much this is about the road vs. the field, and would like to see it a little sharper (sharpening should be the last thing you do after all your adjustments, including resize.  You''d be amazed what a difference that makes to your shot.  I like how the tractor is partially hidding behind the trees and the yellow wheel and the red attachment are poking through.  Placement according to the rule of third (with the tractor on the right side and road in front of it to drive on) would''ve been even better.', '2002-06-12 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72598, 2355, 1054, '<td valign="top">I wish that tree weren''t obscuring the subject.</td>', 'I wish that tree weren''t obscuring the subject.', '2002-06-12 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72599, 2355, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I learnedwhat some veggies looked like this way before I saw them "up close." But I can''t quite tell in this one...maybe tomatoes?</td>', 'I think I learnedwhat some veggies looked like this way before I saw them "up close." But I can''t quite tell in this one...maybe tomatoes?', '2002-06-13 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72600, 2355, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems like the factor is blurred or out of focus...  also the left tree is very distracting -- it gets in the way of everything.</td>', 'Seems like the factor is blurred or out of focus...  also the left tree is very distracting -- it gets in the way of everything.', '2002-06-13 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72601, 2355, 1455, '<td valign="top">Its Corn............</td>', 'Its Corn............', '2002-06-14 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72602, 2355, 1707, '<td valign="top">US flag nice touch with traditional American wheels</td>', 'US flag nice touch with traditional American wheels', '2002-06-15 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72603, 2357, 2078, '<td valign="top">great symmetry! =)</td>', 'great symmetry! =)', '2002-06-10 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72604, 2357, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though the main subject really isn''t road.  =/</td>', 'Nice shot, though the main subject really isn''t road.  =/', '2002-06-10 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72605, 2357, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great shot.I payed over $2.50 for a post card that wasn''t as good as this!!!</td>', 'Great shot.I payed over $2.50 for a post card that wasn''t as good as this!!!', '2002-06-10 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72606, 2357, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the boats in the foreground and background.  Strong repetitive elements.</td>', 'I like the boats in the foreground and background.  Strong repetitive elements.', '2002-06-10 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72607, 2357, 327, '<td valign="top">Look at all that $$$$$$$$$$$ Wow. Nice shot.</td>', 'Look at all that $$$$$$$$$$$ Wow. Nice shot.', '2002-06-10 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72608, 2357, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like this bridge and I think I see what you''re after. The angle is good, but the overall composition might look better if the distractive foreground could be mostly cropped out. Maybe a tigher crop on the bridge shot higher? Good exposure and nice subject!</td>', 'I like this bridge and I think I see what you''re after. The angle is good, but the overall composition might look better if the distractive foreground could be mostly cropped out. Maybe a tigher crop on the bridge shot higher? Good exposure and nice subject!', '2002-06-10 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72609, 2357, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice harbor shot... I love the railroad bridge... i think that railway photogrpahy is becoming one of my favorite subjects... When I look at this photo and think of "On the Road", I have a difficult time determining how this photo conveys that concept to me.  If I were looking at this shot, not knowing anything about this challenge, I would think that the boats and the water were the main subject.  This doesn''t strongly convey the challenge concept to me...</td>', 'This is a very nice harbor shot... I love the railroad bridge... i think that railway photogrpahy is becoming one of my favorite subjects... When I look at this photo and think of "On the Road", I have a difficult time determining how this photo conveys that concept to me.  If I were looking at this shot, not knowing anything about this challenge, I would think that the boats and the water were the main subject.  This doesn''t strongly convey the challenge concept to me...', '2002-06-10 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72610, 2357, 1944, '<td valign="top">Looks like the railroad bridge from the Chrittendon Locks in Ballard WA, but I''m probably wrong. Good photo.</td>', 'Looks like the railroad bridge from the Chrittendon Locks in Ballard WA, but I''m probably wrong. Good photo.', '2002-06-10 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72611, 2357, 1897, '<td valign="top">this is a little bit busy, but good effort</td>', 'this is a little bit busy, but good effort', '2002-06-11 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72612, 2357, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, could be a postcard.  But I don''t see how this fits the Challenge.</td>', 'Nice picture, could be a postcard.  But I don''t see how this fits the Challenge.', '2002-06-11 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(72613, 2357, 1005, '<td valign="top">Two bridges!  The car bridge kinda obscures your train bridge.  No complaint or suggestions, job well done.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 7</td>', 'Two bridges!  The car bridge kinda obscures your train bridge.  No complaint or suggestions, job well done.Photo 9 Creativity 6 Road 7 total 7', '2002-06-11 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72614, 2357, 1313, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-06-11 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72615, 2357, 1054, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed, excellent range of brightness/color.</td>', 'Beautifully composed, excellent range of brightness/color.', '2002-06-13 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72616, 2357, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit static and flat. A more interesting angle of the bridge, not centred and lined up with the horizon like that, would be a lot more appealing.</td>', 'Seems a bit static and flat. A more interesting angle of the bridge, not centred and lined up with the horizon like that, would be a lot more appealing.', '2002-06-14 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72617, 2357, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love sailboats.  Great picture.  Not really any obvious way I''d try and suggest changes.  I also see how you fit this into the road challenge, but the shot is really more about sail boats.</td>', 'Oh, I love sailboats.  Great picture.  Not really any obvious way I''d try and suggest changes.  I also see how you fit this into the road challenge, but the shot is really more about sail boats.', '2002-06-14 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72618, 2358, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast of the sun behind the bridge.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast of the sun behind the bridge.', '2002-06-10 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72619, 2358, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though the main subject really isn''t road.  =/</td>', 'Nice shot, though the main subject really isn''t road.  =/', '2002-06-10 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72620, 2358, 1897, '<td valign="top">poor exposure, good effort</td>', 'poor exposure, good effort', '2002-06-10 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72621, 2358, 641, '<td valign="top">really good shot, with the sunset and the water reflections.</td>', 'really good shot, with the sunset and the water reflections.', '2002-06-10 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72622, 2358, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, and technically flawless.  It''s somewhat of a stretch to fir the theme, since you can''t really see the road, but I keep coming back to look at this, so I''m still giving it a good score.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, and technically flawless.  It''s somewhat of a stretch to fir the theme, since you can''t really see the road, but I keep coming back to look at this, so I''m still giving it a good score.', '2002-06-10 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72623, 2358, 327, '<td valign="top">pretty sunset, clean, clear shot. Well done.</td>', 'pretty sunset, clean, clear shot. Well done.', '2002-06-10 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72624, 2358, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice silouette.  Sunset is a nice touch, but 5 minutes earlier might have been more dramatic.  Well done, no other nits to pick with you.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 7</td>', 'Really nice silouette.  Sunset is a nice touch, but 5 minutes earlier might have been more dramatic.  Well done, no other nits to pick with you.Photo 7 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 7', '2002-06-10 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72625, 2358, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset... good job</td>', 'Nice sunset... good job', '2002-06-10 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
