(72642, 2360, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, lots of interest, while driving is a nice touch, but wasn''t it a far reach to the right hand side of the car?  (I think you mean, the car was in motion, someone else was driving. GRIN)  I really like this one.  (At least one of my top five)  Were I to suggest ANY changes, I would have tried to center the group in the mirror more.  But this was a photo of opportunity, take what you can get!!!!  Photo 10 Creativity 10 ++ Road 10 total 10 (what else?)</td>', 'Nice perspective, lots of interest, while driving is a nice touch, but wasn''t it a far reach to the right hand side of the car?  (I think you mean, the car was in motion, someone else was driving. GRIN)  I really like this one.  (At least one of my top five)  Were I to suggest ANY changes, I would have tried to center the group in the mirror more.  But this was a photo of opportunity, take what you can get!!!!  Photo 10 Creativity 10 ++ Road 10 total 10 (what else?)', '2002-06-10 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
