(72656, 2361, 1175, '<td valign="top">you are a bit too far from your subject.  You''ve got to much distraction in the photo such as the two cones and all the empty space in front of the cars.  You should get in tight and give me a feeling that these are real cars.  You might want to consider making 2 lines of cars so that you can get in tigher.  I also like how you left space in front of the first car to give the viewer a feeling that this car will be going somewhere.</td>', 'you are a bit too far from your subject.  You''ve got to much distraction in the photo such as the two cones and all the empty space in front of the cars.  You should get in tight and give me a feeling that these are real cars.  You might want to consider making 2 lines of cars so that you can get in tigher.  I also like how you left space in front of the first car to give the viewer a feeling that this car will be going somewhere.', '2002-06-10 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72657, 2361, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. lol  Might of turned them all this way to make them appear lined up at the starting line, but I see your idea and it''s very creative.</td>', 'Fun shot. lol  Might of turned them all this way to make them appear lined up at the starting line, but I see your idea and it''s very creative.', '2002-06-10 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
