(72719, 2365, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I guess it''s inevitable that a flower will be submitted to every challenge.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I guess it''s inevitable that a flower will be submitted to every challenge.  Nice DOF.', '2002-06-16 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72720, 2367, 2, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of sideview mirror shots (and taken a bunch myself), but I''m very impressed with this one.  Obviously, getting your hand entirely out of the picture is a tough task.  Try this shots at different times of day to get a more interesting sky?</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of sideview mirror shots (and taken a bunch myself), but I''m very impressed with this one.  Obviously, getting your hand entirely out of the picture is a tough task.  Try this shots at different times of day to get a more interesting sky?', '2002-06-10 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72721, 2367, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well done, good work.</td>', 'Nice shot, well done, good work.', '2002-06-10 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72722, 2367, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like that you focused on the mirror, I hope that doesn''t hurt you for the blurry cars, but they are in the background, scr*w em!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 9</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like that you focused on the mirror, I hope that doesn''t hurt you for the blurry cars, but they are in the background, scr*w em!Photo 9 Creativity 8 Road 9 total 9', '2002-06-10 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72723, 2367, 573, '<td valign="top">Are you in an Explorer?</td>', 'Are you in an Explorer?', '2002-06-11 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72724, 2367, 1877, '<td valign="top">nothing really special .. i mean good idea, but there should be something worthy of looking at in the mirror. Play off the words on the mirror.. seeing something relating to size, etc.. sorry.</td>', 'nothing really special .. i mean good idea, but there should be something worthy of looking at in the mirror. Play off the words on the mirror.. seeing something relating to size, etc.. sorry.', '2002-06-12 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72725, 2367, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice mirror shot!  Here''s a note that may help you with a shot like this in the future... your depth of field (aperture setting) in this shot is deep enough to get the mirror itself in focus.  However, the objects that are in your mirror needed MORE depth of field to bring them into sharper focus...  when photographing a reflection, your depth of field must be deep enough to cover it as if it was NOT a reflection... The motion blur in this photo also adds a nice effect... good work!</td>', 'Nice mirror shot!  Here''s a note that may help you with a shot like this in the future... your depth of field (aperture setting) in this shot is deep enough to get the mirror itself in focus.  However, the objects that are in your mirror needed MORE depth of field to bring them into sharper focus...  when photographing a reflection, your depth of field must be deep enough to cover it as if it was NOT a reflection... The motion blur in this photo also adds a nice effect... good work!', '2002-06-12 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72726, 2367, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the mirror to capture this; I wish your elbow weren''t in frame though.</td>', 'I like the use of the mirror to capture this; I wish your elbow weren''t in frame though.', '2002-06-13 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72727, 2367, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and nicely blurred.   I''d like to see a diff angle so that you could be able to crop it tighter.</td>', 'Nicely framed and nicely blurred.   I''d like to see a diff angle so that you could be able to crop it tighter.', '2002-06-17 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72728, 2368, 1, '<td valign="top">This has great potential, but the sepia tone doesn''t work with the trees in the background... the people heads/hats and most of the car get lost in the dark background.  It would be much better if it was on the sky.</td>', 'This has great potential, but the sepia tone doesn''t work with the trees in the background... the people heads/hats and most of the car get lost in the dark background.  It would be much better if it was on the sky.', '2002-06-10 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72729, 2368, 641, '<td valign="top">classic shot..really good.</td>', 'classic shot..really good.', '2002-06-10 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72730, 2368, 1897, '<td valign="top">this could have been cropped for a much better affect, also, the hats really do not fit</td>', 'this could have been cropped for a much better affect, also, the hats really do not fit', '2002-06-10 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72731, 2368, 885, '<td valign="top">This would look really authentically old without the line of cars in the top right corner.  Was that intentional?</td>', 'This would look really authentically old without the line of cars in the top right corner.  Was that intentional?', '2002-06-10 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72732, 2368, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia tone. Nice job, well done.</td>', 'Love the sepia tone. Nice job, well done.', '2002-06-10 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72733, 2368, 1009, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone...</td>', 'I like the sepia tone...', '2002-06-10 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72734, 2368, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and the sepia works well for this one. It''s not every day one gets a chance to shoot something like this. It looks like an opportunistic shot. Given the same car at a different location (without the new model cars and telephone wires, this would be even better. Regardless, it is very good!</td>', 'Nice shot, and the sepia works well for this one. It''s not every day one gets a chance to shoot something like this. It looks like an opportunistic shot. Given the same car at a different location (without the new model cars and telephone wires, this would be even better. Regardless, it is very good!', '2002-06-10 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72735, 2368, 1313, '<td valign="top">Wish it were in color but still better than most.</td>', 'Wish it were in color but still better than most.', '2002-06-10 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
