(72737, 2368, 1446, '<td valign="top">Perfect subject choice with a sepia.  The Telephone poles and modern automobiles are what kept me from giving you a perfect 10.  Still a very nice shot.  I rated it an 8.</td>', 'Perfect subject choice with a sepia.  The Telephone poles and modern automobiles are what kept me from giving you a perfect 10.  Still a very nice shot.  I rated it an 8.', '2002-06-11 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
