(72743, 2368, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia!  I bet they were only moving about 5 miles per hour.. I get behind slowpokes like this all the time :)  The grain in this photo DOES add to the ''antique'' quality offered by this sepia image.</td>', 'Nice sepia!  I bet they were only moving about 5 miles per hour.. I get behind slowpokes like this all the time :)  The grain in this photo DOES add to the ''antique'' quality offered by this sepia image.', '2002-06-12 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
