(72782, 2371, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice automotive photograph.  I also know that automobiles travel ''on the road''.  This particular shot doesn''t give me a sense of being on the road though.  As for the photo itself, I would have possibly cropped a tad tighter to remove the windshield that is visible in the upper right corner.  The photo is nice.. The challenge interpretation, in my opinion, is weak...</td>', 'This is a nice automotive photograph.  I also know that automobiles travel ''on the road''.  This particular shot doesn''t give me a sense of being on the road though.  As for the photo itself, I would have possibly cropped a tad tighter to remove the windshield that is visible in the upper right corner.  The photo is nice.. The challenge interpretation, in my opinion, is weak...', '2002-06-10 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
