(72805, 2372, 2109, '<td valign="top">awesome!  What is that?</td>', 'awesome!  What is that?', '2002-06-11 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72806, 2372, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the light zips across the shot. I am left wondering how you managed to illuminate the forward side of the face, look forward to hearing about it in the forums.  There are a couple of VERY small flash''s of light that are a little distracting, but overall a very good photograph IMO.</td>', 'I really like the way the light zips across the shot. I am left wondering how you managed to illuminate the forward side of the face, look forward to hearing about it in the forums.  There are a couple of VERY small flash''s of light that are a little distracting, but overall a very good photograph IMO.', '2002-06-11 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72807, 2372, 806, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2002-06-11 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72808, 2372, 2094, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m really impressed how sharp you got this to turn out. I would have expected more blur on the hand and arm. The burst of light is great as well...</td>', 'Wow, I''m really impressed how sharp you got this to turn out. I would have expected more blur on the hand and arm. The burst of light is great as well...', '2002-06-11 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
