(72844, 2373, 2109, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the glasses tells it all.  Did your arm get tired?</td>', 'The reflection in the glasses tells it all.  Did your arm get tired?', '2002-06-11 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
