(72850, 2373, 472, '<td valign="top">a clean shot. no real problems. but not very interesting: just a regular guy driving.</td>', 'a clean shot. no real problems. but not very interesting: just a regular guy driving.', '2002-06-12 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72851, 2373, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, including the reflection in the glasses.</td>', 'Nice angle, including the reflection in the glasses.', '2002-06-13 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72852, 2373, 1031, '<td valign="top">I might have had the model look more to the left to lose the reflection of the arm and camera -- no big dial though.</td>', 'I might have had the model look more to the left to lose the reflection of the arm and camera -- no big dial though.', '2002-06-13 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72853, 2373, 772, '<td valign="top">you better watch out for that bus behind you!  Good shot!</td>', 'you better watch out for that bus behind you!  Good shot!', '2002-06-13 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72854, 2373, 811, '<td valign="top">Hey, now we can see where we''ve been, AND where we''re going.  The red shirt gives some energy to the picture.</td>', 'Hey, now we can see where we''ve been, AND where we''re going.  The red shirt gives some energy to the picture.', '2002-06-13 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72855, 2373, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection on sunglasses, can even see that it is indeed you who''s taking the pic.</td>', 'Nice reflection on sunglasses, can even see that it is indeed you who''s taking the pic.', '2002-06-14 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72856, 2373, 1, '<td valign="top">The subject is more of you and not the road.  The challenge wasn''t self portrait.</td>', 'The subject is more of you and not the road.  The challenge wasn''t self portrait.', '2002-06-16 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72857, 2374, 1122, '<td valign="top">Funny topic and fit this week''s challenge too.<br/>And I like the sleepy and bored look of the little girl as well!<br/>Great Job!</td>', 'Funny topic and fit this week''s challenge too.And I like the sleepy and bored look of the little girl as well!Great Job!', '2002-06-10 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72858, 2374, 205, '<td valign="top">I wonder if she''d actually make it. Hopefully R. Kelly wouldn''t pick her up. Very creative.</td>', 'I wonder if she''d actually make it. Hopefully R. Kelly wouldn''t pick her up. Very creative.', '2002-06-10 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72859, 2374, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I think the cropping on the top and bottom is a little tight however... a little more breathing room there would be a nice improvement :)</td>', 'Nice shot!  I think the cropping on the top and bottom is a little tight however... a little more breathing room there would be a nice improvement :)', '2002-06-10 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72860, 2374, 2, '<td valign="top">Did you try taking any shots that look less posed?  I do like this shot, though.  My only technical complaint is that the girl''s head is slightly cut off.</td>', 'Did you try taking any shots that look less posed?  I do like this shot, though.  My only technical complaint is that the girl''s head is slightly cut off.', '2002-06-10 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72861, 2374, 641, '<td valign="top">Her look on her face is so great ! Really cute shot.</td>', 'Her look on her face is so great ! Really cute shot.', '2002-06-10 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72862, 2374, 1856, '<td valign="top">cute...how much did you have to pay her for this one??</td>', 'cute...how much did you have to pay her for this one??', '2002-06-10 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72863, 2374, 203, '<td valign="top">I love the picture.  Please learn to shot B&amp;W or use color.  You must have both black and white you have neither just shades of gray.  The wonderful composition looks dull flat and lifeless because of that.  If it were a balck and white or a technicaly good color I''d Give it at least an 8.  BTW B&amp;W was a good choice for the historic feel it just needed to be done right.</td>', 'I love the picture.  Please learn to shot B&W or use color.  You must have both black and white you have neither just shades of gray.  The wonderful composition looks dull flat and lifeless because of that.  If it were a balck and white or a technicaly good color I''d Give it at least an 8.  BTW B&W was a good choice for the historic feel it just needed to be done right.', '2002-06-10 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72864, 2374, 1897, '<td valign="top">I was going to do something like this, but I could not get my 19month old to stand still</td>', 'I was going to do something like this, but I could not get my 19month old to stand still', '2002-06-10 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72865, 2374, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2002-06-10 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72866, 2374, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the tones, creative, clever, great job.</td>', 'Love the tones, creative, clever, great job.', '2002-06-10 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72867, 2374, 1009, '<td valign="top">Good one... very nice.</td>', 'Good one... very nice.', '2002-06-10 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72868, 2374, 1759, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. It is original and well executed. The B&amp;W works good here. Good job.</td>', 'I really like this one. It is original and well executed. The B&W works good here. Good job.', '2002-06-10 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
