(72871, 2374, 1540, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but you cropped it too close for my taste..</td>', 'nice shot, but you cropped it too close for my taste..', '2002-06-11 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72872, 2374, 573, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on what I like about this picture.  Is it the little girl expression ''Mom don''t make me pose for another picture again.'' or Somebody please help me get ou''ta this place.''</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on what I like about this picture.  Is it the little girl expression ''Mom don''t make me pose for another picture again.'' or Somebody please help me get ou''ta this place.''', '2002-06-11 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72873, 2374, 878, '<td valign="top">Very cute</td>', 'Very cute', '2002-06-11 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72874, 2374, 811, '<td valign="top">This is entirely too funny.  I love the expression on her face.  She looks totally bored/frustrated/annoyed.   I really like the use of bw in this picture.  Great job.  This picture is one that I just want to keep coming back to look at. :-)</td>', 'This is entirely too funny.  I love the expression on her face.  She looks totally bored/frustrated/annoyed.   I really like the use of bw in this picture.  Great job.  This picture is one that I just want to keep coming back to look at. :-)', '2002-06-11 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72875, 2374, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W work, but I find the execution of the theme somewhat weak. Yes, it''s cute, but to me it''s obviously staged for the purpose of cuteness.</td>', 'Nice B/W work, but I find the execution of the theme somewhat weak. Yes, it''s cute, but to me it''s obviously staged for the purpose of cuteness.', '2002-06-11 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72876, 2374, 1519, '<td valign="top">This one is too cute! Great idea! Nice positioning, love the props, expression, and I think b/w is perfect! High score!</td>', 'This one is too cute! Great idea! Nice positioning, love the props, expression, and I think b/w is perfect! High score!', '2002-06-11 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72877, 2374, 885, '<td valign="top">Perfect expression, wardrobe, and accessories.  Wish I could read the ''d''.  I like the B&amp;W.  Nitpick about cutting off a tiny bit of the head, and I wish those cars weren''t there, as it seems to spoil the somewhat ''old Hollywood'' feel of it.</td>', 'Perfect expression, wardrobe, and accessories.  Wish I could read the ''d''.  I like the B&W.  Nitpick about cutting off a tiny bit of the head, and I wish those cars weren''t there, as it seems to spoil the somewhat ''old Hollywood'' feel of it.', '2002-06-12 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72878, 2374, 1446, '<td valign="top">Adorable idea.  B&amp;W works well for me here (heck pretty much always-lol). The only thing I might change would be to frame it so that the mountains in the background did not appear to cut off her head.</td>', 'Adorable idea.  B&W works well for me here (heck pretty much always-lol). The only thing I might change would be to frame it so that the mountains in the background did not appear to cut off her head.', '2002-06-12 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72879, 2374, 472, '<td valign="top">one of my fave pics in this challenge. tells a great story. very cute girl.  the framing, exposure, composition all are right on. i hope you win.</td>', 'one of my fave pics in this challenge. tells a great story. very cute girl.  the framing, exposure, composition all are right on. i hope you win.', '2002-06-12 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72880, 2374, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great embodiment of the theme!</td>', 'Great embodiment of the theme!', '2002-06-12 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72881, 2374, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m sure hoping this is a staged and not candid photo...</td>', 'I''m sure hoping this is a staged and not candid photo...', '2002-06-13 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72882, 2374, 1175, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Great image.  An actual picture with some sort of meaning or story.  You don''t see that often on here, I''m afraid I''m not so good at it either.  Did you cut the top of her head off on purpose?  If so what was the reason?  I kinda don''t like it but I''m not marking you down for it.</td>', 'Awesome.  Great image.  An actual picture with some sort of meaning or story.  You don''t see that often on here, I''m afraid I''m not so good at it either.  Did you cut the top of her head off on purpose?  If so what was the reason?  I kinda don''t like it but I''m not marking you down for it.', '2002-06-13 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72883, 2374, 1, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot -- SO setup, but SO well done.</td>', 'Awesome shot -- SO setup, but SO well done.', '2002-06-13 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72884, 2374, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfully set up shot..   All I see that might need improvement is the etail could have been clearer, and it looks like you may have cropped a little close.   Otherwise, super!</td>', 'This is a wonderfully set up shot..   All I see that might need improvement is the etail could have been clearer, and it looks like you may have cropped a little close.   Otherwise, super!', '2002-06-13 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72885, 2374, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the composition, especially the streetlamps lined up in the background. It seems a bit too staged for me, but still appealing.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the composition, especially the streetlamps lined up in the background. It seems a bit too staged for me, but still appealing.', '2002-06-14 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72886, 2374, 1707, '<td valign="top">Perfect  vertical lines!</td>', 'Perfect  vertical lines!', '2002-06-14 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72887, 2374, 1041, '<td valign="top">I totally love this shot.  Would''ve done well in people and b&amp;w as well as this challenge.  If only you hadn''t cropped the top of her hat and I think I would''ve tried positioning her a little further to the right in the shot.  Anyway, in my top 10.</td>', 'I totally love this shot.  Would''ve done well in people and b&w as well as this challenge.  If only you hadn''t cropped the top of her hat and I think I would''ve tried positioning her a little further to the right in the shot.  Anyway, in my top 10.', '2002-06-14 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72888, 2374, 47, '<td valign="top">why is this black and white ?</td>', 'why is this black and white ?', '2002-06-15 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72889, 2374, 173, '<td valign="top">Cropping Explanation: I cropped the top of her hat because there was a street lamp behind her and it looked like it was coming out of the top of her head. To address whether or not she''d ''make it'', in spite of the fact that she''s starting in Alaska, she is a determined little girl and I am she she''d find a way. Thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'Cropping Explanation: I cropped the top of her hat because there was a street lamp behind her and it looked like it was coming out of the top of her head. To address whether or not she''d ''make it'', in spite of the fact that she''s starting in Alaska, she is a determined little girl and I am she she''d find a way. Thanks for all the comments.', '2002-06-17 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72890, 2374, 47, '<td valign="top">you could have cropped it so there was only one row of pixels across the top that contained the street lamp. i''m pretty sure no one would notice or comprehend it. suppose then you''d have to crop the shoes at the bottom to match ?</td>', 'you could have cropped it so there was only one row of pixels across the top that contained the street lamp. i''m pretty sure no one would notice or comprehend it. suppose then you''d have to crop the shoes at the bottom to match ?', '2002-06-18 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72891, 2374, 3044, '<td valign="top">i just joined this site today. i have been looking at a lot of the photos. this one is one of my favorites. some one made the comment about learning to shoot b&amp;w. i think maybe they need to adjust their monitor. i think this photo has a good tonal range and is a very nice b&amp;w. the cropping doesnt bother me in the least. to me the best photographs are the ones that stir the emotions in the viewers. this photo should be judged on that basis more than the techncal side, which i dont  think is lacking at all. keep up the good work.</td>', 'i just joined this site today. i have been looking at a lot of the photos. this one is one of my favorites. some one made the comment about learning to shoot b&w. i think maybe they need to adjust their monitor. i think this photo has a good tonal range and is a very nice b&w. the cropping doesnt bother me in the least. to me the best photographs are the ones that stir the emotions in the viewers. this photo should be judged on that basis more than the techncal side, which i dont  think is lacking at all. keep up the good work.', '2002-08-01 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72892, 2375, 142, '<td valign="top">Your local shopping cart guy has more stuff than ours.  I wonder if that is a sign of wealth amongst the street people.  Anyway, good job.</td>', 'Your local shopping cart guy has more stuff than ours.  I wonder if that is a sign of wealth amongst the street people.  Anyway, good job.', '2002-06-10 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72893, 2375, 1856, '<td valign="top">good subject...I''d like to see more of his/her surroundings and a tad more focus.</td>', 'good subject...I''d like to see more of his/her surroundings and a tad more focus.', '2002-06-10 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72894, 2375, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love real life photos... and this is one of the best.</td>', 'I love real life photos... and this is one of the best.', '2002-06-10 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72895, 2375, 1569, '<td valign="top">The focus is slightly off --otherwise a really good photo!!</td>', 'The focus is slightly off --otherwise a really good photo!!', '2002-06-10 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72896, 2375, 327, '<td valign="top">Every city, every country all around the world. Nice light in this shot.</td>', 'Every city, every country all around the world. Nice light in this shot.', '2002-06-10 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72897, 2375, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very good picture... maybe work on the focus a little.</td>', 'Very good picture... maybe work on the focus a little.', '2002-06-10 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72898, 2375, 737, '<td valign="top">Truly a moving picture if you think about it. Send it to your local paper.</td>', 'Truly a moving picture if you think about it. Send it to your local paper.', '2002-06-10 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72899, 2375, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good capture! You might want to have a little off center subject (I''m considering the street person and the cart all one subject). A little extra room to the left might give less of a static feel, more like the person is moving forward.</td>', 'Good capture! You might want to have a little off center subject (I''m considering the street person and the cart all one subject). A little extra room to the left might give less of a static feel, more like the person is moving forward.', '2002-06-10 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72900, 2375, 1944, '<td valign="top">Or still....</td>', 'Or still....', '2002-06-10 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
