(72902, 2375, 806, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalism. I like that you can''t see the person''s face.... this could be anyone, even ourselves.</td>', 'Great photojournalism. I like that you can''t see the person''s face.... this could be anyone, even ourselves.', '2002-06-11 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
