(72909, 2375, 1175, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  LIke the subject.  Need to touch up contrast just a bit for my tastes.  keep up the good work.</td>', 'Good photo.  LIke the subject.  Need to touch up contrast just a bit for my tastes.  keep up the good work.', '2002-06-11 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72910, 2375, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture.  It looks like a little touch of sharpening might be useful, but it''s a tough call because I also like it a little soft.  Here''s a suggestion I offer, but it''s not something I''m letting influence the way I vote about this.  Instead of the warm yellow tone of the picture, you might try giving it a colder blue tone in an editing program.  It would help give it even more of a sense of isolation and desparation.</td>', 'Very interesting capture.  It looks like a little touch of sharpening might be useful, but it''s a tough call because I also like it a little soft.  Here''s a suggestion I offer, but it''s not something I''m letting influence the way I vote about this.  Instead of the warm yellow tone of the picture, you might try giving it a colder blue tone in an editing program.  It would help give it even more of a sense of isolation and desparation.', '2002-06-12 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72911, 2375, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna end up like this if i don''t stop spending money on camera stuff...</td>', 'I''m gonna end up like this if i don''t stop spending money on camera stuff...', '2002-06-12 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72912, 2375, 1658, '<td valign="top">I personally really like this photo.  It conveys a strong image.  I would have liked to see a sharper focus, and more of the shadows.  But really good.</td>', 'I personally really like this photo.  It conveys a strong image.  I would have liked to see a sharper focus, and more of the shadows.  But really good.', '2002-06-12 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72913, 2375, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject!</td>', 'Great choice of subject!', '2002-06-12 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72914, 2375, 1031, '<td valign="top">Thanks for including this -- both for the subject and as a reminder that photojournalism can include good photography.</td>', 'Thanks for including this -- both for the subject and as a reminder that photojournalism can include good photography.', '2002-06-13 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72915, 2375, 2123, '<td valign="top">I like the mood the setting sun adds, a touch blurred though?</td>', 'I like the mood the setting sun adds, a touch blurred though?', '2002-06-13 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72916, 2375, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about a picture that tells a story!  Did you try this in black and white?  That would have helped eliminate some of the background "color" and made it seem more "bleak."  Good job.</td>', 'Wow, talk about a picture that tells a story!  Did you try this in black and white?  That would have helped eliminate some of the background "color" and made it seem more "bleak."  Good job.', '2002-06-13 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72917, 2375, 1379, '<td valign="top">This makes me remind myself how fortunate I am in life.  Ample food, stable shelter, people that love me....  This socially conscious picture is depressingly incredible.</td>', 'This makes me remind myself how fortunate I am in life.  Ample food, stable shelter, people that love me....  This socially conscious picture is depressingly incredible.', '2002-06-13 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72918, 2375, 1707, '<td valign="top">oh, makes me feel sad.  Good job on bringing out the reaility of being homeless.</td>', 'oh, makes me feel sad.  Good job on bringing out the reaility of being homeless.', '2002-06-14 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72919, 2375, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nicely caught. This seems like a journalistic photo to me, something that would accompany a story about poverty, or can even say enough by itself to stand alone. The composition is very strong, the way the person is straining to pull the trolley creates a lot of tension. The long shadows give that feeling of either dusk or dawn (it''s hard to tell), times of the day that have a special emotional impact on the viewer. I think I feel like giving this 10 since I had to look at it for so long to work out why I like it so much :)</td>', 'Very nicely caught. This seems like a journalistic photo to me, something that would accompany a story about poverty, or can even say enough by itself to stand alone. The composition is very strong, the way the person is straining to pull the trolley creates a lot of tension. The long shadows give that feeling of either dusk or dawn (it''s hard to tell), times of the day that have a special emotional impact on the viewer. I think I feel like giving this 10 since I had to look at it for so long to work out why I like it so much :)', '2002-06-14 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72920, 2375, 472, '<td valign="top">i see people like this everyday where i work.  i take pictures of them, too : )</td>', 'i see people like this everyday where i work.  i take pictures of them, too : )', '2002-06-15 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72921, 2375, 2235, '<td valign="top">Good piece of "city scape". Things we see that are sometimes overlooked. Center of interest caught with all object in focus and showing storyline.</td>', 'Good piece of "city scape". Things we see that are sometimes overlooked. Center of interest caught with all object in focus and showing storyline.', '2002-06-16 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72922, 2375, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very well done, the lighting/framing/angle is perfect.</td>', 'Great shot.  Very well done, the lighting/framing/angle is perfect.', '2002-06-16 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72923, 2375, 616, '<td valign="top">Good subject.</td>', 'Good subject.', '2002-06-16 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72924, 2376, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in this photograph.  Great capture.</td>', 'I love the lines in this photograph.  Great capture.', '2002-06-10 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72925, 2376, 1, '<td valign="top">Great framing, very clear and crisp -- well done.</td>', 'Great framing, very clear and crisp -- well done.', '2002-06-10 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72926, 2376, 327, '<td valign="top">Taxes! Fun shot. Well done.</td>', 'Taxes! Fun shot. Well done.', '2002-06-10 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72927, 2376, 1543, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-06-10 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72928, 2376, 1897, '<td valign="top">It lacks impact, maybe in BW or a different time of day, or better post processing.the shapes are good, but do not really lead the viewer anywhere.</td>', 'It lacks impact, maybe in BW or a different time of day, or better post processing.the shapes are good, but do not really lead the viewer anywhere.', '2002-06-11 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72929, 2376, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Another one of those photos that makes interesting of the mundane. I''m not sure about the shadow though, did you try this at different times of the day? (as if we have all day every day to get the perfect shot)</td>', 'Very nice composition. Another one of those photos that makes interesting of the mundane. I''m not sure about the shadow though, did you try this at different times of the day? (as if we have all day every day to get the perfect shot)', '2002-06-11 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72930, 2376, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good visual design. It looks like it was taken plus or minus three hours of noon, and the quality of the light is quite harsh. I''d grade it two points higher if you had had a sunrise or sunset glow on the bridge surfaces.</td>', 'Good visual design. It looks like it was taken plus or minus three hours of noon, and the quality of the light is quite harsh. I''d grade it two points higher if you had had a sunrise or sunset glow on the bridge surfaces.', '2002-06-11 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72931, 2376, 2135, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I assume the main focus of this image is the overhead roadways crossing each other. If so, cropping the image with more of the sky above/less of the road below (where you''re standing) would have captured and centralized the main focus better.  <br/>Good eye!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I assume the main focus of this image is the overhead roadways crossing each other. If so, cropping the image with more of the sky above/less of the road below (where you''re standing) would have captured and centralized the main focus better.  Good eye!', '2002-06-11 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72932, 2376, 2094, '<td valign="top">Such cool architecture... Very nice!</td>', 'Such cool architecture... Very nice!', '2002-06-12 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72933, 2376, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and leading lines.</td>', 'Nice shadows and leading lines.', '2002-06-12 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72934, 2376, 772, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  A road on a road on a road :)</td>', 'Good shot!  A road on a road on a road :)', '2002-06-12 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72935, 2376, 1031, '<td valign="top">I see you can get a clearer picture if you aren''t driving*...nice yellow signs too.<br/>*See my entry for "Transitions" for the reference.</td>', 'I see you can get a clearer picture if you aren''t driving*...nice yellow signs too.*See my entry for "Transitions" for the reference.', '2002-06-13 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72936, 2376, 983, '<td valign="top">Love the symetry and line control in this image.</td>', 'Love the symetry and line control in this image.', '2002-06-13 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72937, 2376, 472, '<td valign="top">woah, makes me dizzy just looking at it.  seems like you have the basis of a really interesting photo here but something isnt hitting.  maybe if you had just gone in on the over passes, and left out the bottom road and extraneous tree stuff to the right...</td>', 'woah, makes me dizzy just looking at it.  seems like you have the basis of a really interesting photo here but something isnt hitting.  maybe if you had just gone in on the over passes, and left out the bottom road and extraneous tree stuff to the right...', '2002-06-13 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72938, 2376, 1707, '<td valign="top">It''s definately a jungle during the rush hours!</td>', 'It''s definately a jungle during the rush hours!', '2002-06-14 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72939, 2376, 2210, '<td valign="top">Nice lines</td>', 'Nice lines', '2002-06-14 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72940, 2376, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think this already cool perspective would''ve been even cooler with some cars on the road.  But then, I don''t know whether you spent a long time hanging out by the road trying to get a shot w/out cars ... just different tastes maybe.</td>', 'I think this already cool perspective would''ve been even cooler with some cars on the road.  But then, I don''t know whether you spent a long time hanging out by the road trying to get a shot w/out cars ... just different tastes maybe.', '2002-06-14 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72941, 2376, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The signs add a nice element of colour and further enhance the curvy theme of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice composition. The signs add a nice element of colour and further enhance the curvy theme of the photo.', '2002-06-15 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72942, 2376, 2235, '<td valign="top">Title says it all. Well framed. Exposure is good for that time of day. Lack of vehicles works in the photo. I like to see it with sun on bridges. Might be a bit more striking for contrast. Good shot overall.</td>', 'Title says it all. Well framed. Exposure is good for that time of day. Lack of vehicles works in the photo. I like to see it with sun on bridges. Might be a bit more striking for contrast. Good shot overall.', '2002-06-16 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72943, 2376, 318, '<td valign="top">This should have been the winner, IMHO. Nice curves, left and right, like the signs too, they compliment the 2 curves.</td>', 'This should have been the winner, IMHO. Nice curves, left and right, like the signs too, they compliment the 2 curves.', '2002-06-21 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(72944, 2378, 1897, '<td valign="top">the more I see this the more I like it</td>', 'the more I see this the more I like it', '2002-06-10 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
