(72964, 2378, 811, '<td valign="top">the steering wheel (?) being in focus leads me to believe the rest of the picture is supposed to be out of focus.  That''s cool, but the steering wheel isn''t that interesting to me.  I like the blue hues.</td>', 'the steering wheel (?) being in focus leads me to believe the rest of the picture is supposed to be out of focus.  That''s cool, but the steering wheel isn''t that interesting to me.  I like the blue hues.', '2002-06-14 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
