(72966, 2378, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love what you did with the colours in this photo. The steering wheel has an interesting texture, but the photo itself seems disorienting. It''s nice that it has an impact of some kind though.</td>', 'I love what you did with the colours in this photo. The steering wheel has an interesting texture, but the photo itself seems disorienting. It''s nice that it has an impact of some kind though.', '2002-06-16 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
