(72969, 2379, 1569, '<td valign="top">I really like this one---the potrion with the actual bike and riders foot is (to my taste) unnecessary. The shadow is a really strong image on its own--still a great shot.</td>', 'I really like this one---the potrion with the actual bike and riders foot is (to my taste) unnecessary. The shadow is a really strong image on its own--still a great shot.', '2002-06-10 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
