(72971, 2379, 203, '<td valign="top">Should have saved this for this week.  Congrats yours is vote 86 of 108 and of the 2 dozen or so B&amp;W attempts it is the only one that is not a gray and gray.</td>', 'Should have saved this for this week.  Congrats yours is vote 86 of 108 and of the 2 dozen or so B&W attempts it is the only one that is not a gray and gray.', '2002-06-10 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
