(72988, 2379, 1005, '<td valign="top">Next week!  (joke)  Really good shot, works well in B&amp;W.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 8</td>', 'Next week!  (joke)  Really good shot, works well in B&W.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Road 8 total 8', '2002-06-11 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72989, 2379, 1078, '<td valign="top">I love the "illusion" in this that the shadow and its creator have switched places.  Great call to turn it the 180.  I''m having a hard time defining the element that''s niggling at me.  Perhaps that it''s so bright?  Pretty much purely black and white (I recognize that there''s a lot of gray -- it''s just very light).  I wonder if bring up the midtones, making the ground a little darker, would help.  Dunno, just my two bits.</td>', 'I love the "illusion" in this that the shadow and its creator have switched places.  Great call to turn it the 180.  I''m having a hard time defining the element that''s niggling at me.  Perhaps that it''s so bright?  Pretty much purely black and white (I recognize that there''s a lot of gray -- it''s just very light).  I wonder if bring up the midtones, making the ground a little darker, would help.  Dunno, just my two bits.', '2002-06-12 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72990, 2379, 1, '<td valign="top">Very interesting framing and angle.  It would''ve worked better in the Shadow challenge, eh? :)</td>', 'Very interesting framing and angle.  It would''ve worked better in the Shadow challenge, eh? :)', '2002-06-12 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72991, 2379, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great angle!!</td>', 'Very nice, great angle!!', '2002-06-12 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72992, 2379, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe that this is probably my favorite photo this week.  I wish I had an *eye* for creativity like this.  This photo definitely stands out in this pack as the most creative.  The upright and horizontal orientation of the shadow in this shot is perfect for me :)  The shadow is leveled out nicely to offer a very high contrast against the road surface, and I love the way the black and white choice accents that contrast.  On the technical side of this photo, I don''t know how much post processing was done, but assuming that it wasn''t a lot, you may have been slightly over exposed... the road surface looks a little ''hot''.  Excellent photo! = 10</td>', 'I believe that this is probably my favorite photo this week.  I wish I had an *eye* for creativity like this.  This photo definitely stands out in this pack as the most creative.  The upright and horizontal orientation of the shadow in this shot is perfect for me :)  The shadow is leveled out nicely to offer a very high contrast against the road surface, and I love the way the black and white choice accents that contrast.  On the technical side of this photo, I don''t know how much post processing was done, but assuming that it wasn''t a lot, you may have been slightly over exposed... the road surface looks a little ''hot''.  Excellent photo! = 10', '2002-06-12 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72993, 2379, 472, '<td valign="top">very creative. i like the inversion of shadow and reality.  one of my 5 best.</td>', 'very creative. i like the inversion of shadow and reality.  one of my 5 best.', '2002-06-12 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72994, 2379, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Black and white works well here.  It seems a little pixelated, but is very nice nonetheless - 9</td>', 'I really like this one.  Black and white works well here.  It seems a little pixelated, but is very nice nonetheless - 9', '2002-06-13 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72995, 2379, 1031, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been great for this week''s too...I like the way you''ve "reversed roles" betwen shadow and object.</td>', 'Would''ve been great for this week''s too...I like the way you''ve "reversed roles" betwen shadow and object.', '2002-06-13 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72996, 2379, 1175, '<td valign="top">I probably like this picture more than other people do.  I like seeing objects at strange angles almost as if it were a mistake.  This could have been a great submission for next weeks challenge. :)</td>', 'I probably like this picture more than other people do.  I like seeing objects at strange angles almost as if it were a mistake.  This could have been a great submission for next weeks challenge. :)', '2002-06-13 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72997, 2379, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I love the angle, the blacks and whites. It''s perfect for this challenge.....heck, even next week''s challenge! One of my 10''s this week. :)</td>', 'I love this shot. I love the angle, the blacks and whites. It''s perfect for this challenge.....heck, even next week''s challenge! One of my 10''s this week. :)', '2002-06-13 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72998, 2379, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the "real" image is in the place the shadow would have normally been.  This would be an awesome shot for this week''s challenge as well.  Great job.</td>', 'I like the way the "real" image is in the place the shadow would have normally been.  This would be an awesome shot for this week''s challenge as well.  Great job.', '2002-06-13 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(72999, 2379, 208, '<td valign="top">I really like how you made this vertical rather than horizontal.</td>', 'I really like how you made this vertical rather than horizontal.', '2002-06-13 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73000, 2379, 1651, '<td valign="top">excellent. i like how there''s a lot going on in this shot but without being too busy.</td>', 'excellent. i like how there''s a lot going on in this shot but without being too busy.', '2002-06-13 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73001, 2379, 2126, '<td valign="top">Nicely rotated - when the image is loading slowly it looks like the shadow and the bike are reversed. Maybe get rid of the blur next time? It might remove the feeling of action, but I guess it''s personal choice</td>', 'Nicely rotated - when the image is loading slowly it looks like the shadow and the bike are reversed. Maybe get rid of the blur next time? It might remove the feeling of action, but I guess it''s personal choice', '2002-06-14 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73002, 2379, 2199, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2002-06-14 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73003, 2379, 2047, '<td valign="top">cool!  Would have been better on the shadow challenge!</td>', 'cool!  Would have been better on the shadow challenge!', '2002-06-15 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(73004, 2379, 1831, '<td valign="top">Very creative, good work."9"</td>', 'Very creative, good work."9"', '2002-06-15 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
